<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="DEU" style="id">Deuteronomy</book>
  <para style="h">Deuteronomy</para>
  <para style="toc1">Deuteronomy</para>
  <para style="toc2">Deuteronomy</para>
  <para style="mt">Deuteronomy</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hêng thu hi Jordan chhak lam thlalêr, Paran leh Tophel leh Laban leh Hazeroth leh Di-zahab inkâra Suph va dep, Araba-a Mosian Israel mi zawng zawng hnêna a sawi chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Horeb tlâng aṭangin Kadesh-barnea chu Seir tlâng lam kawngah ni sâwm leh ni khat kal a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, kum sawmli kum, thla sâwm leh thla khatna, chumi thla ni khat nî chuan heti hi a ni a, Lalpan anmahni hrilh tûra thu a pêk ang zawng zawng chu Israela thlahte hnênah Mosian a sawi a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hesbon-a awm Amor-ho lal Sihona leh Edrei leh Astaroth-a awm Basan lal Oga a thah hnuin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jordan chhak lam Moab ramah he dân hi Mosian a puang ṭan ta a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“ Lalpa kan Pathian chuan Horeb tlângah min bia a, ‘He tlângah hian in awm rei tâwk tawh e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Insuan tawh ula, kal chhuak ula, Amor-ho tlâng ramah leh a chheh vêl zawng zawng, Araba-ah te, tlâng ramah te, phai ramah te, Chhim ramah te, Kanaan-hote awmna tuifinriat kamah te leh Lebanon-ah te, luipui, Euphrates lui thlengin kal rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ngai teh u, ram chu ka pe tawh diam a che u; in pu Abrahama te, Isaaka te, Jakoba te leh an hnua an thlah leh zêlte hnêna chhechhama Lalpan a pêk ram chu va luah rawh u,’ tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, chumi lai chuan in hnênah, ‘Keimah ngawt chuan ka zo lo che u a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathian chuan a tipung che u a, ngai teh u, tûnah hian in tam lam chu vâna arsi zât zet a lo ni ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lalpa , in pi leh pute Pathian chuan tûn aia a lêt sângin tipung che u sela, a tiam che u angin malsâwm che u rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Engtin nge keimah chauhvin in buaina te, in phurrit te, in innghirnghona te chu ka phurh zawh ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />In hnam zînga mi, mi fing, hmang hre mi, chinchâng hre mite inthlang chhuak ula, in chunga hotuah ka siam ang e,’ tiin ka bia che u a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, nangnin, ‘I thil sawi chu kan tân a ṭha hle mai,’ tiin mi chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chutichuan, in hnam hotute chu ka pawm a, in hnam zînga mi, mi fing, chinchâng hre mite in chunga hotuah ka siam a, sâng chunga hotu te, za chunga hotu te, sawmnga chunga hotu te, sâwm chunga hotu te, puipate pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, chumi lai chuan in rorêltute chu, ‘In unaute kâra thu chu ngaihthlâksak ula, unau leh unau kârah leh ram dang mi, a awmpui nêna an kârah fel takin rêl rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Rorêlnaah thlei bîk in nei tûr a ni lo; mi tê leh mi lian inang rengin in ngaihthlâksak tûr a ni; tu mah in hlau tûr a ni lo; rorêlna chu Pathian ta a ni si a: in tâna thu khirh lutuk chu ka hnênah in rawn thlen thîn ang a; tin, chu chu ka lo ngaithla ṭhîn ang,’ tiin thu ka pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, chumi lai chuan thil in tih dân tûr zawng zawngah thu ka pe che u a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan thu min pêk angin Horeb tlâng aṭang chuan kan chhuak a, Amor-ho tlâng ram kawnga thlalêr zau tak leh râpthlâk tak in hmuh kha kan kal tlang vek a, Kadesh-barnea khua kan va thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, in hnênah, ‘ Lalpa kan Pathianin min pêk Amor-ho tlâng ram chu in lo thleng ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ngai teh u, Lalpa in Pathianin ram chu a pe tawh diam che u a ni; chho ula, Lalpa in pi leh pute Pathianin a lo sawi tawh ang khân han luah rawh u; hlau suh ula, zâm hek suh u,’ ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, ka hnênah in lo kal vek a, ‘A ram te va thlîthlaia, kan chhohna tûr lam kawng leh kan va kalna tûr khaw chanchin te min rawn hrilh leh tûrin, kan hmaah mi va tîr ila,’ in ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chu chuan mi tilâwm hle mai a; tichuan, in zînga mi, mi sâwm leh pahnih, hnam khata pakhat zêl ka thlang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />tichuan, an chhuak ta a, tlângah chuan an lâwn chho va, Eskol ruam an han thleng a, an en thlîthlai vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chu rama theite chu an lo va, min rawn hawn a, chanchin min rawn thlen a, ‘ Lalpa kan Pathianin ram min pêk chu ṭha tak a ni,’ an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Nimahsela, in chho duh lo va, Lalpa in Pathian thupêk chu in helsan a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />in puan inahte in phunnawi a, ‘ Lalpa chuan min huat avângin min tiboral tûra Amor-hote kuta pêk tûrin Aigupta ram ata min hruai chhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Khawiah chuan nge kan han chhoh vang? Kan unaute chuan, “Mihring chu kan aiin an lian a, an sâng zâwk bawk a; khuate chu a lian hle a, vân tawngin kulh a nei; tin, Anak-ho thlahte pawh kan hmu bawk a,” tiin kan thinlung an titui a,’ in ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, keiin in hnênah, ‘Anmahni chu ṭih suh ula, hlau bawk hek suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathian, in hmahruaitu chuan in mit hmuha Aigupta rama a tihsak tâk che u zawng zawng ang khân, a beihpui ang che u a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />thlalêrah pawh miin a fa a pua angin, Lalpa in Pathian chuan hemi hmun in thlen thleng hian, kawng tluanin a puak zia che u in hmuh kha,’ ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Nimahsela, chuti chung pawhin in puan in zârna tûr zawnsak tûr leh in kalkawng kawhhmuh tûra zâna meia, chhûna chhûma in hma hruaitu Lalpa in Pathian chu in ring lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan in thusawi chu a lo hria a, a thinrim a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />‘He chhuan sual taka mi hi chuan pakhat tê mahin, in pi leh pute pêk tûra chhia ka chham ram ṭha tak chu an hmu lo vang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Jephunea fapa Kaleba chauh lo chuan; ani zawngin a hmu ang; a va rah ram chu amah leh a fate ka pe ang, ani chuan Lalpa chu a pawm tlat avangin,’ tiin chhia a chham a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Nangmahni avângin ka chungah pawh Lalpa chu a thinur a, ‘Nang pawh hi chutah chuan i lût lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />I rawngbâwltu Nuna fapa Josua hi chu a lût ang; ani hi fuih rawh, Israel-hote chu a luahtîr dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />In fanau tê tê, “Râllâkin an la mai ang,” in tih leh, tûna a chhia a ṭha la hre lo in fate hi an lût ang a, anni chu ka pe ang a, an luah ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Nangni erawh chu insuan ula, Tuifinriat Sen lamah thlalêrah kal rawh u,’ tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tin, nangnin, ‘ Lalpa chungah kan lo sual ta a ni, kan han chho vang a, Lalpa kan Pathianin thu min pêk zawng zawng angin kan han bei ang e,’ tiin mi chhâng a. Tichuan, indona thuamhnaw in inbel ṭheuh va, tlânga han chhoh chu thil namênah in ngai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan ka hnênah, ‘Chho suh u, han bei bawk hek suh u; in zîngah ka awm si lo, in hmêlmate chuan an lo tihlum dah ang che u, an hnênah ti rawh,’ mi ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Chu chu ka hrilh che u a, in pawm lo va, Lalpa thupêk chu in helsan ta zâwk a, tlângah chuan in han chho lui ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tin, chu tlânga awm Amor-ho chuan an lo bei che u a, khuai mi ûm angin an lo ûm che u a, Seir aṭangin Horma thlengin an that zêl che u a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tin, in lo kîr leh a, Lalpa hmaah in ṭap a; nimahsela, Lalpa chuan in aw chu a ngaithla duh lo va, a beng pawh a rawn chhi duh lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Chutichuan, chuta in awm chhûng chu han ngaihtuahin Kadesh-ah chuan rei tak in awm a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, kan insuan a, Lalpan ka hnêna a sawi angin Tuifinriat Sen lamah thlalêrah kan lût ta a; Seir tlâng chu rei tak kan vêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan mi bia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />‘He tlâng hi in vêl rei tâwk tawh e; hmâr lam panin insuan tawh rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mipuite chu Seir tlânga awm, Esauva thlah in unaute ramah in kal tlang dâwn a ni; anni chuan an lo hlau vang che u a; chuvângin, fîmkhur hle ula;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />bei suh ang che u; an ram chu a khawii lai mah, kephaha rah khawp lek pawh ka pe dâwn hauh lo a che u; Seir tlâng chu a pualah Esauva ka pe tawh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />An chaw te chu in eiah sumin in lei ang a; tin, an tuite chu in inah sumin in lei bawk tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathian chuan in thawh apiangah te mal a sâwm ṭhîn che u a, he thlalêr zau tak hi in kal tlang dân te chu a hre si a; hêng kum sawmli chhûng zawng hian Lalpa chu in hnênah a awm a, eng mah in tlâkchham loh kha, tiin thu pe rawh,’ tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chutichuan, Elath leh Ezion-geber aṭangin Araba kawnga kalin Seir tlânga awm Esauva thlah kan unaute ram kan pal tlang a. Tin, kan insuan a, Moab thlalêr lamah kan kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan ka hnênah, ‘Moab-ho chu tibuai suh ula, râl beihin bei suh u; an ram chu in pualah ka pe dâwn lo a che u, Lota thlahte pualah Ar chu ka pe tawh a ni.’ ”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />(Tûn hma lam chuan Anak-ho angin mi lian leh tam leh mi sâng pui pui Em-ho an awm thîn a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />chûngho pawh chu Anak-ho ang bawka Repha-ho tih an ni a; nimahsela, Moab-ho chuan Em-ho an ti ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tûn hma lam chuan Seir tlângah hian Hor-ho pawh an awm bawk ṭhîn a; nimahsela, Esauva thlahte hian an luahsak a; an that a, a hmunah chuan an awm ta a, Israel-hovin Lalpan an puala a pêk ram an tih ang khân.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chutichuan, tho ula, Zered lui chu kân rawh u khai,’ a ti a. Tichuan, Zered lui chu kan kân ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kadesh-barnea aṭangin kan chhuak leh a, Zered lui kan kân a, Lalpan an hnêna chhia a chham anga, mipui zînga chumi chhuana râl kâp mi zawng zawng an mang vek inkâr chu, kum sawmthum leh kum riat a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mipui zîng ata an boral dêr hma loh chuan anmahni tiboral tûrin Lalpa kutin a tai reng bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chutianga mipui zîng ata râl kâp mi zawng zawng an borala, an lo thih zawh hnu chuan heti hi a ni a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lalpan min bia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />‘Vawiinah hian Moab ram, Ar chu i kal tlang tûr a ni a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />tin, Amona thlahte ep i va thlen hnaih pawhin tibuai suh la, bei hek suh; Amon-ho ram chu i pualah ka pe dâwn lo che, Lota thlahte pualah ka pe tawh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />(Chu pawh chu Repha-ho rama ngaih a ni bawk; chutah chuan tûn hma lamin Repha-ho an awm ṭhîn a. Nimahsela, Amon-ho chuan Zamzum-ho an ti ṭhîn a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Anak-ho anga mi lian leh tam leh mi sâng pui pui an ni a; nimahsela, Lalpan a tihboralsak a, an luah ve ta thung a, an hmunah chuan an awm ta a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Seir tlânga awm Esauva thlahte chu Hor-ho a tihboralsak laia a tih ang khân; tichuan, an luah ve ta thung a, an hmunah chuan tûn thleng hian an la awm ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, Gaza thlenga khaw tê têa awm Av-ho chu Kaptor aṭanga lo chhuak Kaptor-hovin an tiboral a, an hmunah chuan an awm ta a.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tho ula, kal chhuak ula, Arnon ruam kân rawh u; ngai teh u, Amor mi Hesbon lal Sihona leh a ram chu ka pe tawh che u a ni. Luah phawt ula, râl beihin bei rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Vawiinah hian, vân hnuai chhîna hnam tin chungah chuan nangmah ṭihna leh hlauhna ka awm ṭantîr ang a, i chanchin an lo hria ang a, an khûr ang a, nangmah avângin na tak tuarin an awm ang,’ tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, Kedemoth thlalêr aṭangin Hesbon lal Sihona hnênah rem thu kengin mi ka tîr a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />‘I ramah hian mi kal tlangtîr rawh khai; lamlianah zêl ka kal ang a, ding lamah emaw, vei lamah emaw pawh ka pêng lo vang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ka eiah chaw a leiin sumin mi leitîr ang a, ka inah tui pawh sumin mi leitîr bawk ang a; Jordan ka kâna Lalpa kan Pathianin min pêk ram ka luh hma loh chuan, Seir-a awm Esauva thlahte leh Ar-a awm Moab-hote mi tih ang khân mi kal tlangtîr ringawt mai rawh khai,’ tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Nimahsela, Hesbon lal Sihona chuan a ramah min kal tlangtîr phal lo va; Lalpa in Pathian chuan in kuta a pêk theihna tûr che uin a rilru a tikhauh va, a tiluhlul a ni, in hriat tâk ang hian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan ka hnênah, ‘Ngai teh, Sihona leh a ram chu ka pe dâwn ta che a ni, a ram chu nei tûrin luah phawt mai rawh,’ mi ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tichuan, Sihona leh a mite zawng zawng chu Jahaz-a min bei tûrin an lo thawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa kan Pathian chuan min pe a; tichuan, amah leh a fapate leh a mite zawng zawng chu kan that a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tin, chumi ṭum chuan a khua zawng zawng chu kan la a, chûng khuaa mihring zawng zawng chu, hmeichhia leh an fanau tê tête nên lam kan tiboral vek a, zuah rêng rêng kan nei lo va;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />kan lâk khuaa râllaka kan lâk thil leh rante chauh kan pualah kan la a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Arnon ruam fêma Aroer aṭanga Gilead thlengin, kan tân sâng lutuk khua a awm hauh lo mai a, Lalpa kan Pathianin min pe vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Amona thlahte ram chauh in hnaih lo a ni, Jabok lui lehlam kam zawng zawng leh tlâng rama khuate leh, Lalpa kan Pathianin min khapna apiangte nên.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chutichuan, kan insuan a, Basan kawngah kan chho va; Basan lal Oga leh a mite zawng zawng chu Edrei-a min bei tûrin an lo thawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan ka hnênah, ‘Amah chu hlau suh, amah leh a mite zawng zawng leh a ram chu i kutah ka pe tawh diam a ni; Hesbon-a awm Amor-ho lal Sihona chunga i tih ang khân a chungah i ti dâwn nia,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Chutichuan, Lalpa kan Pathian chuan Basan lal Oga pawh a mite zawng zawng nên kan kutah a pe a; tichuan, pakhat tê mah zuahsak lovin kan that vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chumi ṭum chuan a khua zawng zawng khaw sawmruk, Basan-a Oga ram, Argob ram zawng zawng chu kan la vek a; kan lâksak loh khaw pakhat tê mah a awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hêng khua zawng zawng hi kulh sâng tak tak, kawngkhâr leh kalhna nei vek a ni a, kulh nei lo khaw tam tak tiam lo pawhin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hesbon lal Sihona chunga kan tih ang khân kan tiboral vek a, khuaa mihring zawng zawng chu kan tiboral vek a, hmeichhia leh an fanau tê tête nên lam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, ran zawng zawng leh khuaa râllâka kan lâk thilte chu kan pualah kan la a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chumi ṭum chuan Jordan râla awm Amor-ho lal pahnih kut ata chu, Arnon ruam aṭanga Hermon tlâng thlenga ram chu kan la a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />(chu Hermon chu Zidon-ho chuan Sirion an ti a, Amor-ho chuan Senir an ti a ni;)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />phai ram khua zawng zawng leh Gilead ram zawng zawng leh Basan ram zawng zawng nên, Basan rama Oga ram khua, Saleka leh Edrei thlengin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />(Basan lal Oga chauh a ni, Repha-ho zînga la awm chhun chu; ngai teh, a khum chu thîr a ni; Amona thlahte khua Raba-ah chuan a la awm reng a ni lâwm ni? Mihring tawnga tehin a dung lam tawng kua, a vâng lam tawng li a ni.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chumi ṭum chuan chumi ram chu kan luah a; Arnon ruam kianga Aroer aṭangin Gilead tlâng ram zâtve thlengin, chuta khaw awmte nên Reuben-ho leh Gad-ho ka pe a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />tin, Gilead ram la awm zawng leh Oga ram Basan zawng zawng chu Manase hnam zâtvete ka pe a; Argob ram zawng zawng leh Basan ram zawng zawng chu. (Hei hi Rephaim-ho ram an ti bawk ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Manasea fapa Jaira chuan Argob ram zawng zawng, Gesur-ho leh Maakath-ho ram thlengin a la a, chûng chu, Basan chu, ama hming chawiin Havoth-jaira a ti a, tûn thlengin a la ti reng.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Gilead chu Makira ka pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Reuben-ho leh Gad-ho chu Gilead aṭanga Arnon ruam, ruam lai tak thlengin an ram chin atân ka pe a, Amona thlahho ramri, Jabok lui thlengin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />tin, Araba leh Jordan pawh ramri atân Kinereth aṭanga Pisga chhak lam pangpêr hnuaia Tuifinriat Al, Araba tuifinriat thlengin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, chumi lai chuan, ‘ Lalpa in Pathianin he ram hi in pualah a pe che u a ni, Israela thlah, in unaute hmaah in mi huaisen zawng zawng chu inrâlthuamin han kal ve rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, nangmahni anga in unaute chu Lalpan râlmuanga a siam hma leh Lalpa in Pathianin Jordan râla ram a pêk chu an luah ve hma loh chuan, in nupuite leh in fanau tê tête leh in rante chu (ran in ngah tih ka hria a) in khua ka pêk tâk che uah hian lo awm sela; tichuan, in pual ṭheuh tûra ka pêk che uah hian in lo haw leh ṭheuh dâwn nia,’ tiin thu ka pe che u a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, chumi lai bawk chuan Josua chu, ‘ Lalpa in Pathianin chûng lal pahnihte chunga thil a tih zawng zawng chu i mitin a hmu vek a; chutiang tak bawk chuan in luhna tûr ram zawng zawng chungah Lalpan a ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Anmahni chu hlau suh ang che u; a beihpuitu che u chu Lalpa in Pathian a ni si a,’ tiin thu ka pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, chumi lai vêk chuan, ‘Aw Lalpa Pathian, i chhiahhlawh hnênah hian i ropuizia leh i kut chak tak chu i lantîr ta phawt chu a ni a; vânah emaw, leiah emaw hian i thiltih ang leh i thiltih ropui tak ang ti thei Pathian hi tu nge awm?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mi kaitîr la, Jordan râla ram ṭha tak, chu tlâng mawi tak leh Lebanon chu mi hmuhtîr teh khai,’ tiin, Lalpa chu ka ngên chiam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Nimahsela, nangmahni avângin ka chungah Lalpa chu a thinur hle a, ka thu chu a pawm lo va; tichuan, Lalpa chuan, ‘Tâwk tawh rawh se, he thûah hian mi be leh tawh suh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Pisga tlâng chhipah han chuang la, thlang lamah te, hmâr lamah te, chhim lamah te, chhak lamah te i mit han lên la, han thlîr rawh; Jordan hi i kân dâwn lo a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, Josua hi thu pe la, fuih ṭha la, tichak rawh; hêng mipuite hi a hruai kai dâwn a, i han hmuh tûr ram chu a luahtîr dâwn a ni,’ mi ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Chutichuan, Beth-peor ep ruamah chuan kan awm ta a nih kha.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khai le, aw Israel mite u, Lalpa , in pi leh pute Pathianin ram a pêk che u chu nungdama in luah theihna tûra in pawm tûra ka zirtîr ṭhin che u dânte leh rorêlte chu ngaithla rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathian thupêk ka pêk che u hi in pawm theihna tûrin, thu ka pêk che u hi in belhchhah tûr a ni lo va, in tikiam tûr a ni hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Baal-peor avânga Lalpa thiltih chu in mitin a hmu a; Baal-peor betu zawng zawngte chu Lalpa in Pathianin in zîng ata a tiboral a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathian vuantu apiangte erawh chu tûn thleng hian nungdamin in la awm ṭheuh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ngai teh u, in va luah tûr ramah pawh in zawm zêl tûrin, Lalpa ka Pathianin thu mi pêk ang takin dânte leh rorêlte chu ka zirtîr che u a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chutichuan, pawm ula, zâwm rawh u; chu tak chu, hêng dân zawng zawngte hi hriaa, ‘He hnam ropui tak hi mi fing tak leh thil hre mi tak an ni ngei mai,’ titu hnamte mit hmuhah chuan in finna leh thil hre mi in nihna a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kan koh apianga Lalpa kan Pathianin min hnaih anga anmahni hnaih ṭhîn Pathian nei hnam ropui tu nge awm ve?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Heti taka fel, dânte leh rorêlte, tûna in hmaa ka zam zawng zawng ang dân nei hi hnam ropui dang tu nge awm ve?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Eng pawh ni sela, fîmkhur ula, ngun takin invawng phawt mai rawh u; chuti lo chuan, in mitin a thil hmuhte chu in theihnghilh ang a, in dam chhûngin in thinlung ata a bo dah ang e. In fate leh in tute zirtîr rawh u;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />tin, Horeb tlânga Lalpa in Pathian hmaa in dina, Lalpan ka hnêna, ‘Mipuite chu min koh khâwmsak rawh, leilunga an awm chhûng zawnga mi ṭih dân an zîr theih nân leh an fate zirtîr tûrin ka thûte ka lo hriattîr ang e,’ mi tih ni pawh kha in theihnghilh dah ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tichuan, in lo hnai a, tlâng bulah chuan in lo ding a, vânlaizâwl tawngin tlâng chu thim te, chhûm te, thim chhah mup te awmtîrin a kâng ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan mei aṭang chuan a rawn bia che u a. A thusawi chu in hria a; nimahsela, riruang eng mah in hmu lo va, aw chauh in hria a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A thuthlung zawm tûra thu a pêk che u, thu sâwm pêk chu in hnênah a puang a, lungphêk pahnihah a ziak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, chumi lai chuan luah tûra in va kaina rama in zawm tûrin dânte leh rorêlte zirtîr tûrin Lalpan thu mi pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chuvângin, fîmkhur hle rawh u; milem insiam chawpin, a pa ang emaw, a nu ang emaw, leia ran ang emaw, boruaka thlâwk ṭhîn, sava thla nei ang emaw, leia a vaha vâk mi ang emaw, lei hnuai tuia sangha zînga mi ang emawte siamin in intichhe dah rual ang e; Horeb tlânga mei aṭanga Lalpan a rawn biak ni che u khân riruang eng mah in hmu si lo va; a nih loh leh vân lam in han hawia, ni te, thla te, arsi te, vâna mi zawng zawngte rêng pawh in han hmuhin, Lalpa in Pathianin vân hnuai chhîna mi zawng zawng a ruatsakte chuan a hîp ang che u a, in bia ang a, an rawng te in bâwl mai dah rual ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lalpa chuan a mite, a ro ni tûrin thîr rawh tuina ata, Aigupta ram ata chu a hruai chhuak zâwk che u a ni, tûna in nih ang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chuti chang pawh ni lovin, nangmahni avângin Lalpa chu ka chungah a thinur a, Jordan lui chu ka kân lohva, in luah atâna ram ṭha tak Lalpa in Pathianin a pêk che uah chuan ka luh loh nân chhia a chham bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kei chu he rama thi tûr ka ni a, Jordan lui chu ka kai dâwn lo a ni; nangni erawh chu in kai ang a, chu ram ṭha tak chu in luah ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Fîmkhur hle rawh u, Lalpa in Pathian thuthlung, in laka a thlun chu in theihnghilh ang a, Lalpa in Pathianin eng anpui maha siam a phal loh milemte in insiam chawp dah rual ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathian chu kan ral hmang mei, thîkthuchhe tak Pathian a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tu leh fate in han neiha, chu rama rei fe in awm hnua, in intihkhawlohva, eng emaw anpuitea milem siam chawp maite in dina, a thin tiur tûra Lalpa in Pathian mit hmuha thil ṭha lo in tih vaih chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Jordan kâna in va luah tûr ram ata chu in boral thuai mai ang tih, in chungchâng thûah min hriatpuitu atân tûnah hian lei leh vân ka sâwm a ni; in chêng rei lo vang a, in boral vek mai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Lalpa chuan hnam tin zîngah a tidarh ang che u, hnamte zîngah chuan tlêm tê chauhvin in awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chutah chuan, pathian, thing leh lunga mihring siam, hmu thei hlei lo, hre thei hlei lo, ei thei hlei lo, rim pawh hre thei hlei lote in bia ang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Nimahsela, chutah pawh chuan Lalpa in Pathian chu in zawna, in thinlung zawng zawng leh in rilru zawng zawnga in zawn chuan in hmu leh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hrehawma in awma, in chunga chûng thil zawng zawng chu a lo thlen hunah, a tâwp a tâwpah chuan Lalpa in Pathian lam in lo hawi leh ang a, a thu chu in pawm tawh ang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathian chu zahngai thei tak Pathian a ni si a; a thlahthlam lo vang che u a, a tiboral lo vang che u a, in pi leh pute hnêna chhechhama a thuthlun chu a theihnghilh hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />In awm hma, tûn hma lam te chu han chhût ula, leilunga Pathianin mihring a siam achin vân hnuai chhînah, hetianga thil ropui hi a awm ngaiin, hriat a ni ngai emaw chu?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Mei aṭanga thu rawn sawi in hriata in la nun cheu sina pathian aw miin an hre ngaiin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />hnam dang zing ata fiahna te, chhinchhiahna te, thilmak te, indona te, kut chak tak te, bân phar te, thil râpthlâk tea Lalpa in Pathianin in mit hmuha Aigupta rama a tih zawng zawng anga hnam hruai chhuak ngam pathian an awm ngai emaw chu?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Lalpa chu Pathian a ni tih in hriat theih nân in hnêna tihlan a ni a; amah lo chu a dang rêng an awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />A zirtîr nân che u vân aṭangin a aw a rawn hriattîr che u a, lei chungah hian a meipui chu a hmuhtîr che u a; mei aṭanga a thu chu in lo hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />In pi leh pute a hmangaih avângin an hnua an thlahte chu a thlang che u a, amah telin, a thiltihtheihna ropui takin hnam dang in aia ropui leh thiltithei zâwk a hnawh chhuahsak che u a, an ram chu luah tûra luhtîr che uin Aigupta ram ata chu a hruai chhuak che u a, tûna in nih ang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Chuvângin, tûnah hian in thinlungah vawng ula, chung lam vânah leh hnuai lam leiah hian Lalpa chu Pathian a ni tih hre rawh u; a dang rêng an awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Kumkhua atâna Lalpa in Pathianin a pêk che u ramah chuan, nangmahni leh in thlahte tâna ṭha tûr leh in chên rei theih nân, a dânte leh a thupêkte, tûna ka pêk che u hi in zâwm tûr a ni,” tih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Chutichuan, Mosia chuan tualthattu, a ṭhenawm khawvêng, tûn hma pawha a huat lêm loh that palhtu tualtlânna, Jordan râl ni chhuahna lampangah khaw pathum a ruat a; chûng khua, a engah pawh a tlân chuan a him ang a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />chûng chu Reuben-ho pualah thlalêra tlâng zâwla Bezer te, Gad-ho pualah Gilead-a Ramoth te, Manase-ho pualah Basan-a Golan te a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tin, hei hi Mosian Israela thlahte dân a pêk chu a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />hêng hi, Aigupta ram ata an lo chhuah laia Israela thlahte hnêna Mosian Jordan râla, Mosia leh Israela thlahten Aigupta rama an lo chhuah laia an thah, Hesbon-a awm Amon-ho lal Sihona rama Beth-peor zâwn ruama a sawi hriattîrna te, dân te, rorêl te chu a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />a ram leh Basan lal Oga ram, Jordan râl ni chhuahna lama Amor-ho lal pahnihte ram chu an luah a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Arnon ruam fêma Aroer aṭanga Sion tlâng (Hermon an ti bawk) thleng leh
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Jordan râl chhak lampang Araba zawng zawng, Pisga pangpêr hnuaia Araba tuifinriat thlengin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Mosian Israel-ho zawng zawng chu a ko khâwm a, an hnênah, “Aw Israel mite u, in zira in pawm tûra dân te, rorêl te in beng hriata vawiina ka sawi hi ngaithla rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa kan Pathianin Horeb-ah chuan kan hnênah thu a thlung a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalpa chuan he thu hi kan pi leh pute hnênah khân a thlung lo va, keiniho, tûn thlênga mi nungdama la awm zawng zawngte hnênah ngei hian a ni, a thlun zâwk ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpa chuan tlângah mei aṭangin inhmatawnin a bia che u a
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />(chumi lai chuan Lalpa thu kawhhmuh tûr che uin Lalpa nêna in inkârah ka ding a; mei avâng chuan in hlau si a, tlângah chuan in han chho lo va):
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kei hi Lalpa i Pathian, Aigupta ram ata, bâwih ata hruai chhuaktu che ka ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Keimah lo chu pathian dang rêng rêng i nei tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Milem siam chawp, chung lam vâna mi emaw, hnuai lam leia mi emaw, lei hnuai lama tuia mi emaw, a eng anpui mah i insiam tûr a ni lo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />chung chu chibai i bûk tûr a ni lo va, an rawng i bâwl tûr a ni hek lo. Kei Lalpa i Pathian hi Pathian thîkthuchhia, pate khawlohna avânga fate hrem ṭhîn, mi hawtute chu chhuan thumna leh chhuan lîna thlenga hrem thîn leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />mi hmangaiha ka thupêkte pawmtu sâng tam takte chunga khawngaihna lantîr ṭhîn ka nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lalpa i Pathian hming chu i lam mai mai tûr a ni lo. Lalpa chuan a hming lam mai maitu chu thiam loh chantîr lohvin a chhuah dâwn si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lalpa i Pathianin thu a pêk che angin Chawlhni chu thianghlim reng tûrin serh rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ni ruk chhûngin i thawk ang a, i hna zawng zawng chu i thawk tûr a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />a ni sarih nî erawh chu Lalpa i Pathian tân Chawlhni a ni e; chumi nî chuan hna rêng rêng i thawk tûr a ni lo, nang pawhin, i fapa pawhin, i fanu pawhin, i bâwihpa pawhin, i bâwihnu pawhin, i bâwngpa pawhin, i sabengtung pawhin, i ran a enga pawhin, i ina ram dang mite pawhin; nangmah ang bawka i bâwihpa te, i bâwihnu te pawh an chawlh theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nang pawh Aigupta ramah khân bâwih i ni tawh a, Lalpa i Pathianin chuta ta chu kut chak tak leh bân phara a hruai chhuah che i ni tih hre reng rawh; chuvâng chuan a ni, Lalpa i Pathianin Chawlhni serh tûr thu a pêk che ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lalpa i Pathianin thu a pêk che angin i nu leh i pa chawimawi rawh; tichuan, Lalpan ram a pêkah che hian i hmuingîl ang a, i dam rei dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tual i that tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />I uire tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />I ru tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />I vêngte chungah hretu derah i insiam tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />I vêngte nupui i awt tûr a ni lo va, i vêngte in emaw, a lo emaw, a bâwihpa emaw, a bâwihnu emaw, a bâwngpa emaw, a sabengtung emaw, i vêngte thil a enga mah i awt tûr a ni lo, tiin.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hêng thûte hi tlângah mei te, chhûm te, thim chhah mup aṭangtein Lalpan aw ring takin in zavaia pung khâwmho hnênah a sawi a, a belhchhah leh chuang lo va. Chûng chu lungphêk pahnihah a ziak a, mi pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, tlâng chu a kan laia, thim aṭanga aw chu in han hriat chuan heti hi a ni a, min rawn hnaih a, in hnam puipa zawng zawng leh in upate chuan;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />tin, ‘Ngai teh, Lalpa kan Pathian chuan kan hnênah a ropuizia leh a lenzia a lantîr a, mei aṭanga a aw chu ka hria a; Pathianin mihring a biak pawha thihna a nih chuan lohna chu vawiinah kan lo hre ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chuvângin, engah nge kan thih ang? Hemi mei nasa tak hian min kâng ral mai ang asin; Lalpa kan Pathian aw chu kan hriat leh chuan kan thi mai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mei aṭanga Pathian nung aw kan hriat anga hre vea dam si, tisa pu zawng zawng zîngah tu nge awm?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Nangin va hnaih la, Lalpa kan Pathianin a sawi tûr zawng zawng chu va ngaithla teh khai; tin, Lalpa kan Pathianin i hnêna a sawi zawng zawng chu nangin kan hnênah i sawi ang a; tichuan, kan lo ngaithla ang a, kan zâwm dâwn nia,’ in ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, mi biak laia in thusawi chu Lalpan a lo hria a; tichuan, Lalpan ka hnênah, ‘Hêng mipuiten i hnêna thu an sawi chu ka lo hria a; an thusawi zawng zawng chu a ṭha hle mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Chutiang rilru chu pu ṭhîn sela aw, mi ṭih ang a, ka thupêkte chu an zâwm fo vang a, anmahni leh an fate pawh kumkhuain an hmuingîl hle tûr.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />An hnênah, “In puan inahte va haw rawh u,” ti rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Nang erawh chu ka kiangah ding la, luah tûra ram ka pêkah an pawm tûra i zirtîr tûr thupêk zawng zawng te, dân te, rorêl te chu ka hrilh ang che,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa in Pathianin thu a pêk che u anga ti tûrin fîmkhur rawh u; ding lamah emaw, vei lamah emaw in pêng tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />In va luah tûr ramah in awma, in hmuingîlna tûr leh in chên rei theih nân Lalpa in Pathianin thu a pêk che u kawng in zawh tluan chhuak tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, luah tûra in va kaina rama in zawm tûr leh nangni leh in fapate leh in tupaten Lalpa in Pathian chu in ṭiha, in dam chhûng zawnga a dân zawng zawng leh a thupêk ka pêk che u hi in zawmna tûr leh, in lo chên rei theihna tûra Lalpa in Pathianin nangmahni zirtîr tûra thu min pêk, thupêk te, dân te, rorêl te chu hêngte hi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chuvângin, aw Israel mite u, in hmuingîla, Lalpa in pi leh pute Pathianin a ṭawngtiam che u angin, hnute tui leh khawizu luanna rama nasa taka in lo pun theih nân ngaithla ula, zâwm tûrin fîmkhur rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aw Israel mite u, ngaithla teh u, Lalpa kan Pathian chauh chu Lalpa a ni a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathian chu in thinlung zawng zawngin, in rilru zawng zawngin, in chakna zawng zawngin in hmangaih tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, hêng thu, vawiina ka pêk che u hi in thinlungah a châm reng ang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />in fate ṭhahnemngai takin in zirtîr ang a, in ina in ṭhut lai te, kawnga in kal lai te, in mut lai te, in thawh hun tein in sawi ṭhîn tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, chhinchhiahna atân in bânah in zem ang a, in mit leh mit inkâra chal hrênna atân a awm bawk tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, in in kawngka biangah te, in kawngkhârah te in ziak tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni ang a, Lalpa in Pathianin in pu, Abrahama te, Isaaka te, Jakoba te hnêna chhechhama a pêk che u ram, in din ni hauh lo, khaw ropui leh mawi tak tak te; in tihkhah ni hauh lo, thil ṭha tinrênga khat in te; in chhun ni hauh lo, tuikhur chhun sa te; in chîn ni hauh lo, grêp huan leh olive thingte awmnaa a hruai luh che ua, in eia, in tlai hle hun chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />fîmkhur hle ang che u; chuti lo chuan, Aigupta ram ata, bâwih ata hruai chhuaktu che u Lalpa in Pathian chu in theihnghilh mai dah ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathian chu in ṭih ang a, ama rawng chu in bâwl ang a, a hming chhâlin chhia in chham tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pathian dang, in vêla mite pathiante chu in be tûr a ni lo,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />in zînga awm Lalpa in Pathian chu Pathian thîkthuchhia a ni; Lalpa in Pathian thin chu in chungah a thawk ang a, leilung ata hi a tiboral mai dah ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Masa-a in fiah ang khân Lalpa in Pathian chu in fiah tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathianin a pêk che u - thupêk te, a thuhriattîr te, a dân te hi fîmkhur takin in zâwm tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />In hmuingîlna tûr leh Lalpan a sawi tawh anga in hmêlma zawng zawng hnawt chhuak tûra, Lalpan in pi leh pute hnêna chhia a lo chham tawh ram ṭha tak chu in va luah theih nân, Lalpa mit hmuha dik leh ṭha chu in ti tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, in faten, ‘ Lalpa kan Pathianin thu a pêk che u thuhriattîr te, dân te, rorêl te hi eng tizia nge ni le?’ tia nakin lama an la rawn zawh hun che u chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />nangnin in fate hnênah, ‘Aigupta ramah Pharaoa bâwih kan ni a, Lalpan Aigupta ram ata chu kut chak takin min hruai chhuak a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />tin, Lalpan kan mit hmuhah Aigupta ram chungah te, Pharaoa chungah te, a chhûngte zawng zawng chungah te, chhinchhiahna leh thilmak nasa tak leh manganthlâk takte a entîr a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />keini erawh chu min pêk tûra kan pi leh pute hnêna chhia a lo chham ram chu min pêk theih nân chuta ta chu min hruai chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tichuan, hêng dân zawng zawng hi zâwm tûr leh kan ṭhat rengna tûra Lalpa kan Pathian chu ṭih tûrin Lalpa chuan thu min pe a, vawiin anga nungdama min zuah reng theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A thu min pêk anga Lalpa hmaa a thupêk zawng zawng zâwm tûra kan fîmkhur chuan kan tân damna a ni dâwn a ni,’ in ti tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathianin in va luah tûr rama a hruai luh che ua, in hmaa hnam tam tak - Hit-ho te, Girgas-ho te, Amor-ho te, Kanaan-ho te, Periz-ho te, Hiv-ho te, Jebus-ho te, in aia ropui leh thiltithei zâwk hnam sarihte a hnawh chhuah hun leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathianin a pêk hun che ua, in thah hunah chuan, in tiboral vek tûr a ni; anmahni nên thu in thlung tûr a ni lo va, in khawngaih tûr a ni hek lo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />nupui pasalah in nei tûr a ni hek lo, in fanute chu an fapate in neihtîr tûr a ni lo va, an fanute chu in fapate in neihtîr tûr a ni hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />In fapate, mi zui lai hi pathian dangte biakna lamah an hruai kawi mai ang a; tin, Lalpa thin pawh chu in chungah a thawk ang a, a tiboral thuai mai ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />An chungah hetiang hian in ti zâwk tûr a ni: an maichâmte in tichim ang a, an lungphunte in tikeh sawm ang a, an Aseri-te in kit ang a, an milem siam chawpte in hâl vek tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathian tân hnam thianghlim in ni si a; leilunga hnam ahluana a pual bîk ni tûra Lalpa in Pathianin a thlan che u in ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hnam dang aia in tam avângin Lalpan in chungah a hmangaihna a fûktîr a, a thlang che u a ni lo va; hnam zawng zawnga hnam tlêm ber in ni asin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lalpan a hmangaih che u avâng leh in pi leh pute hnêna chhia a lo chham chu hlen a duh avâng zâwkin asin, Lalpan Aigupta lal Pharaoa kut ata kut chak takin bâwih ata a tlan chhuah che u ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa in Pathian chu Pathian a ni tih hre rawh u; Pathian rinawm, amah hmangaiha a thu zâwmtu chunga chhuan sâng thlenga thuthlung leh khawngaihna nghat renga,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />amah hawtute tiboral tûra anmahni chung la laa thungrûl ṭhîn a ni; amah hawtute chu a rial rei lo vang a, anmahni chung la laah a thungrûl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chuvângin, thupêk te, dân te, rorêl te zawm tûra vawiina thu ka pêk che u hi in zâwm tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni ang a, hêng rorêlte hi in ngaihthlâka, in zawma, in tih avângin Lalpa in Pathianin in pi leh pute hnêna chhia a lo chham, thuthlung leh khawngaihna chu in chungah a nghat ang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />a hmangaih ang che u a, mal a sâwm ang che u a, a tipung ang che u; pêk tûra in pi leh pute hnêna chhia a chham ramah chuan in rîla rah leh in lei rah pawh mal a sâwm ang, in buh te, in uain te, in hriak te, in bâwngno leh in berâmnote pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hnam zawng zawnga malsâwmna dawng nasa ber in ni ang a; in zîngah a hmei a pa ching rêng rêng an awm lo vang, in ran zîngah pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan hri zawng zawng a tihkiansak vek ang che u a, in hriat tawh hnu Aigupta ram hrite chu in chungah a lêntîr lo vang a, a hawtute che u zawng zawng chungah a lêntîr zâwk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathianin a pêk tûr che u hnam zawng zawng in tiboral vek tûr a ni; in khawngaih tûr a ni lo va, an pathian rawng pawh in bâwl tûr a ni lo; in tân thang a ni dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />In rilrua, ‘Hêng hnamte hi kan aiin an tam si a, engtin nge kan luhchhuah theih ang?’ ti in nih chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />anni chu hlau suh ula; Lalpa in Pathianin Pharaoa leh Aigupta mi zawng zawng chunga a thiltihte kha hre rawh u,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />fiahna nasa tak in mit ngeia in hmuh te, chhinchhiahna te, thilmak te, kut chak tak te, bân phar tea Lalpa in Pathianin a hruai chhuahna che u kha; khatiang khân Lalpa in Pathianin in mi hlauhte chungah chuan a ti zêl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathian chuan an zîngah khawinghal a tîr leh nghâl ang, a la dam, in laka birute chu an boral vek thlengin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Anni chu in hlau tûr a ni lo; Lalpa in Pathian chu in zîngah a awm si a, Pathian ropui tak, ṭihbaiawm tak mai chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathian chuan chûng hnamte chu zawi zawiin a hnawh chhuahsak hret hret ang che u a; in tiboral nghâl mai tûr a ni lo va; chuti lo chuan, ramsate in pawi khawih khawpin an lo pung mai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />An boral hma loh chu Lalpa in Pathianin a pe ang che u a, buai namên lovin a tibuai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />An lalte chu in kutah a pe ang a, an hming chu vân hnuai ata hi in thai bo daih tûr a ni; in tihboral dêr thlengin a chelh tûr che u tu mah rêng rêng an awm lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />An pathian lem siam chawpte chu in hâl tûr a ni; chumia tangkarua emaw, rangkachak emaw chu in ît tûr a ni lo va, in tân in la tûr a ni hek lo; chuti lo chuan, in âwk dah ang e; Lalpa in Pathian ngaihin thil tenawm a ni si a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />in in chhûnga thil tenawm la lûtin, chu thil ang chuan ânchhe dawngah i insiam tûr a ni lo; ten namên lova tenin in haw hle tûr a ni, ânchhe dawng thil a ni si a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nungdama in awma, in lo pun zêla, pêk tûr che ua in pi leh pute hnêna Lalpan chhia a chham ram chu in va luah theih nân, thupêk vawiina ka pêk che u hi zâwm tûrin in fîmkhur tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, a thupêkte chu in zâwm dâwn nge dâwn lo, in rilru hriat nân fiah tûr leh tihrehawm tûr che u a, thlalêra kum sawmli a hruaina zawng zawng che u kawng chu hre reng rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mihring hi chhang chauhvin an nung lo va, Lalpa kâa thu tin chhuakin an nung zâwk a ni tih a hriattîr theih nân che u, a tihrehawm che u a, in ṭâm te a phal a, in hriat ngai loh, in pi leh pute pawhin an hriat ngai bîk loh manna chuan a châwm che u a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hêng kum sawmli chhûng hian in silhfênte chu in sin chul lo va, in kete pawh a vûng lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, miin a fa a thunun ṭhîn angin, Lalpa in Pathian chuan a thunun ṭhîn che u a ni tih hi in rilruin hre reng rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, a kawng zawh tûr leh amah chu ṭih tûrin Lalpa in Pathian thupêkte chu in zâwm tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathian chuan ruam leh tlâng aṭanga lo chhuak lui tui te, tuikhur leh tui thûk tak awmna ram,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />buh te, barli te, grêp te, theipui te, pawmgranet te awmna ram, hriak nei olive leh khawizu awmna ram,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />chham lova chhang in ei ṭhinna tûr ram, eng mah in tlâkchham lohna tûr, a lungte chu thîr, a tlângte chu dâr laih chhuah theihna ram ṭha takah chuan a hruai lût dâwn si che u a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />In eia, in tlai hle hun chuan, ram ṭha tak a pêk che u avâng chuan Lalpa in Pathian chu in fak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A thupêk te, a rorêl te, a dân te, vawiina ka pêk che u hi zâwm lovin Lalpa in Pathian chu in theihnghilh dah rual ang e, fîmkhur rawh u;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />chuti lo chuan, in eia, in tlaia, in ṭha takte in saka, in luah hun leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />in ran rual te, in berâm rual te a lo puna, in tangkarua te, in rangkachak te a lo puna, in thil neih zawng zawngte a lo pun hun chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />in rilrute a lo chapo vang a, bâwih ata Aigupta ram aṭanga hruai chhuaktu che u Lalpa in Pathian chu in theihnghilh mai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ani chuan thlalêr zau tak leh râpthlâk tak, rûl chuk na mite leh khawmualkaikuangte awmna, tui awm lohna, ram rovah a hruai tlang che u a; meilung lungpui aṭangin tui a tihchhuahsak che u a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />in pi leh pute hriat ngai loh manna chuan a châwm che u a, tûn hnu lam thûa in ṭhat theih nân a tihrehawm che u a, a fiah theihna tûr che uin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, ‘Hêng kan sum leh paite hi keimahni chakna leh kan kutkawih a ni,’ in ti rilru dah ang e, fîmkhur bawk rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tûna a ngheh anga in pi leh pute hnêna chhechhama thuthlun chu a tihnghehna tûrin, Lalpa in Pathian chu hre reng rawh u, sum leh pai deh chhuah theihna petu che u chu amah chu a ni zâwk asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni ang a, Lalpa in Pathian chu in theihnghilha, pathian dangte in zuia, an rawngte in bâwla, in biak vaih chuan in boral ngei ngei ang tih vawiinah hian ka hriattîr a che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />In hmaa hnam dangte a tihboral angin nangni pawh in boral ang, Lalpa in Pathian aw chu ngaithla duh lo in nih dâwn avângin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Israel mite u, ngaithla teh u, ‘Anak-ho chu tuin nge chelh ang i?’ an tih ṭhin, in aia ropui leh thiltithei zâwk hnam, khawpui vân tawnga kulh nei leh ropui tak, mi lian tak, sâng pui pui, in hriat tawh sa Anaka thlahte ram chu va luah tûrin tûnah chuan Jordan lui chu in kân dâwn ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa in Pathian chu kan ral hmang mei anga in hmaa kal ṭhîna chu a ni tih tûnah hian hre rawh u; ani chuan anni chu a tiboral ang a, a tihtlâwmsak ang che u a; tichuan, Lalpan in hnêna a sawi tawh ang khân, anni chu in hnawt chhuak ang a, in tiboral thuai mai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathianin a hnawh chhuahsak hnu che u chuan, ‘Kan felna avângin he ram hi luah tûrin Lalpan min hruai lût a ni,’ in rilruin ti hauh suh u; hêng hnamte hi an sual avâng zâwkin a ni, Lalpan a hnawh chhuahsak dâwn che u ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />In fel avâng emaw, in rilru dik avâng emawin an ram chu in luah dâwn lo va, hêng hnam sual avâng leh Lalpan in pu Abrahama te, Isaaka te, Jakoba te hnêna a chhechham thu tinghet tûrin, Lalpa in Pathianin anni chu a hnawh chhuahsak che u a ni zâwk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chuvângin, he ram ṭha tak hi in fel avânga luah tûrin Lalpan a pe che u a ni lo tih hre rawh u; hnam luhlul tak in ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thlalêra Lalpa thin in tihur ṭhinzia te kha hre reng ula, theihnghilh suh u; Aigupta ram ata in chhuah nî aṭanga hemi hmun in lo thlen thleng hian Lalpa chunga hel hmang in ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Horeb-ah pawh khân Lalpa thin in tiur a, tiboral hial tûr che uin Lalpa a thinrim a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lungphêk, in hnêna Lalpa thuthlunna lungphêk, la tûra tlânga ka han chhoh lai khân ni sawmli leh zan sawmli tlângah chuan ka han awm a; chhang pawh ka ei lo va, tui pawh ka in hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan lungphêk pahnih, Pathian kutzunga ziak chu mi pe a; chumiah chuan in pun khâwm nîa tlâng chunga mei aṭanga Lalpan in hnêna thu a sawi zawng zawng kha a chuang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, ni sawmli leh zan sawmli hnuah chuan heti hi a ni a, lungphêk pahnih, thuthlunna lungphêk chu mi pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan ka hnênah, ‘Tho la, heta ta hi chhuk thuai rawh; Aigupta ram ata i hruai chhuah, i mite chu an intihchhiat zawh tâk khu; zawh tûra thu ka pêk kawng ata chu an pêng ta pang mai a, milem chhûn chawp an insiam tâk mai khu,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan, ‘He mite hi ka en ka enin, ngai teh, hnam luhlul tak an ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />anmahni tiboral tûr leh vân hnuai ata an hming thai bo tûrin ka tih tihin ka han ti teh ang: tin, nang hi anmahni aia hnam thiltithei leh ropui zâwkah ka siam teh ang che,’ tiin min be bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chutichuan, tlâng ata chu ka lêt thla a, tlâng chu a kâng ta a; thuthlunna lungphêk pahnih chu ka kut khinghnihin ka keng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, ka han thlîr a, ngai teh u, Lalpa in Pathian chungah in lo sual ta a; bâwngno lem chhûn chawp in insiam a, Lalpan thu a pêk che u kawng ata chu in pêng ta pang mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, lungphêk pahnih chu ka chawi a, ka kut khinghnih ata chu ka paih a, in mit hmuhah ka tikeh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, hmâna ka tih ang khân ni sawmli leh zan sawmli Lalpa hmaah ka bawkkhup a; a thin tiur tûra Lalpa mit hmuha in thil tihsual tâk, in sualna zawng zawng avângin chhang pawh ka ei lo va, tui pawh ka in hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nangmahni tiboral tûra Lalpa thinurna, a thinrimna leh lungnih lohna nasa tak chu ka hlau si a. Nimahsela, chumi ṭum pawh chuan Lalpan ka thu chu mi ngaihthlâksak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chu Arona tiboral duh hial khawpin a thinur a; nimahsela, Arona pawh ka ṭawngṭaisak nghâl bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />In sualna avânga in siam bâwngno lem chu ka la a, ka hâl a, ka chhu sawm a, vaivut angin ka râwt dip derh a; tin, a dip chu tlâng aṭanga lui lo luangah chuan ka paih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, Tabera-ah te, Masa-ah te, Kibroth-hat-ta-ava-ah te pawh Lalpa chu in tithinur a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan , ‘Ram ka pêk che u chu han luah rawh u,’ tia Kadesh-barnea aṭanga a tirh lai che u khân Lalpa in Pathian thupêk chu in helsan a, amah chu in ring lo va, a aw chu in ngaithla bawk hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ka hriat tirh che u ata Lalpa chunga hel hmang mi in ni reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chutichuan, Lalpan , ‘Ka tiboral dâwn,’ a tih che u avâng khân Lalpa hmaah ka bawkkhup a, ni sawmli leh zan sawmli ka bawhkhuh kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa hnênah chuan ka ṭawngṭai a, ‘Aw Lalpa Pathian, ropuinaa i tlan, kut chak taka Aigupta ram ata i tlan chhuah, i mite leh i rochante chu tiboral suh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />I chhiahhlawh Abrahama te, Isaaka te, Jakoba te chu hre reng la, he miteho hi an luhlulzia te, an suahsualzia te, an sualzia teah en suh ang che;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />chuti lo chuan, i mi hruai chhuahna rama mite chuan, Lalpan a ram tiamah chuan a hruai theih loh avâng leh a huat avângin, thlalêra thah tûrin a hruai chhuak a ni, an ti dah ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />I thiltihtheihna ropui tak leh i bân phara i hruai chhuah, i mite leh i rochante an ni miau si a,’ ka ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chumi lai chuan Lalpan ka hnênah, ‘Lungphêk pahnih, hmâna mi ang kha chher leh la, tlângah ka hnênah lo kal la, thingin bâwm siam rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, hmâna lungphêk i tihkeh tâktea thu chuang kha lungphêkahte chuan ka ziak ang a, bâwmah chuan i dah dâwn nia,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tichuan, thingri thingin bâwm ka siam a, hmâna mi ang lungphêk pahnih ka chher a, lungphêk pahnih chu kengin tlângah chuan ka chho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, lungphêkahte chuan a hmasaa ziak ang, in pun khâwm nîa tlânga mei aṭanga Lalpan in hnêna a sawi thu sâwm pêk chu a ziak a, Lalpa chuan mi pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, tlâng ata chu ka lêt thla a, lungphêk chu ka bâwm siamah chuan ka dah a; Lalpan thu mi pêk angin chutah chuan a awm ta reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Israela thlahte chu Beeroth Bene-jaakan aṭangin Mosera-ah an kal a; chutah chuan Arona chu a thi a, tah chuan an phûm a; tin, a fapa Eleazaran a aiawhin puithiam hna a thawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chuta ṭang chuan Gudgoda-ah an kal a; tin, Gudgoda aṭang chuan tui tamna ram Jotbatha-ah an kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chumi lai chuan tûn thlenga Lalpa thuthlung bâwm zâwna, Lalpa hmaa a rawng bâwla, a hminga malsâwmsaktu ni tûrin Levi chi chu a tihrang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chuvângin, Levia chuan a unaute zîngah chanvo pawh, rochan pawh a nei lo va; Lalpa in Pathianin a hnêna a sawi angin Lalpa chu a rochan a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, a hma ang bawk khân tlângah chuan ni sawmli leh zan sawmli ka awm a; tin, chumi ṭum pawh chuan Lalpan ka thu chu a ngaithla a, Lalpa chuan a tiboral duh ta lo che u a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan ka hnênah, ‘Tho la, mipuite hma hruai rawh; anmahni pêk tûra an pi leh pute hnêna chhechhama ka tiam ram chu an luah tûr a ni,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khai le, Israel mite u, in laka Lalpa in Pathianin a phût chu eng mah dang a ni lo va, in ṭhatna tûra Lalpa in Pathian ṭiha, a kawng zawng zawng chu zawha, amah hmangaiha, in thinlung zawng zawng leh in rilru zawng zawnga Lalpa in Pathian rawng bâwla,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lalpa thupêkte, a dânte zawm tûra tûna thu ka pêk che u pawm hi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ngai teh u, vân te, vânte vân leh leilung leh a chhûnga awm zawng zawng hi Lalpa in Pathian ta vek a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nimahsela, in pi leh pute hmangaih chu a lâwm zâwng a ni a, hnam dang zawng zawng aiin nangniho hi a hnam thlan in la ni ta cheu va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chuvângin, in thinlung hmâwr vun tan ula, tihmawh tawh suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathian chu pathiante Pathian, hotute Hotu, Pathian ropui tak, chak tak, ṭihbaiawm tak, tu mah duhsak bîk nei lova, thamna pawh la ngai lo a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pa nei lote leh hmeithaite chu fel takin ro a rêlsak ṭhîn a, ram dang mite chu ei tûr leh silhfênte pein a hmangaih ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chuvângin, ram dang mite chu hmangaih ve rawh u; nangni pawh Aigupta ramah khân ram dang mi in nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathian chu in ṭih ang a, ama rawng chu in bâwl ang a; tin, amah chu in vuan tlat ang a, a hming chhâlin chhia in chham tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amah chu in fak tûra chu a ni, hêng in mita in hmuh tâk thil ropui tak leh râpthlâk takte tihsaktu che u in Pathian a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />In pi leh pute chu Aigupta ramah sawmsarih an chhuk a; tûnah chuan tam lama vâna arsi zâtin Lalpa in Pathianin a titam ta che u a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa in Pathian chu in hmangaihin a thurochhiah te, a dân te, a rorêl te, a thupêk te in zâwm fo tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tûnah hian hre rawh u khai; Lalpa in Pathian thununna te, a ropuizia te, a bân chakzia te, a bân pharzia te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />a chhinchhiahna te, a thiltih, Aigupta ram chhûnga Aigupta lal Pharaoa chung leh a ram chhûng zawng zawnga a tih te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aigupta sipaiho leh an sakawr leh an tawlailîr chunga a thiltih te; an ûm lai che ua, Tuifinriat Sen tuia a vûrtîrzia te, tûn thlenga Lalpan a tihboralzia te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />hemi hmun in thlen hma loh zawnga thlalêra in chunga a thiltih dân te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Reubena fa Eliaba fapa Dathana leh Abirama-te chunga a tih dân te; leiin a kâ a âna Israel mite zawng zawng zînga anmahni leh an chhûngte leh an puan inte leh, an ran hruai zawng zawng a lem vek dân te hre lo in thlahte hnêna sawi ka ni lo va;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />in mit ngeia Lalpan thil ropui tak a tih zawng zawng hmutute hnênah a ni zâwk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chuvângin, in lo chaka, luah tûra in va pan ram chu in luah theih nân leh hnute tui leh khawizu luanna ram, in pi leh pute leh an thlahte pêk tûra Lalpan chhia a chham ramah chuan in chên rei theih nân tûna thu ka pêk che u, thupêk zawng zawngte hi in zâwm tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />In va luah tûr ram chu, in lo chhuahna Aigupta ram, thlai huana chi in tuha, in kea tui in leih ṭhinna ang a ni lo va;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />in va luah tûr ram chu tlângte leh ruam, vân ruahtui dawng ram a ni zâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathian zawn chhuah ram a ni a; Lalpa in Pathian mit chu kum thar aṭanga a tâwp thlengin a fu reng ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni ang a, Lalpa in Pathian chu hmangaih tûr leh, in thinlung zawng zawng leh in rilru zawng zawnga a rawng bâwl tûra ka thupêk, tûna ka pêk che u hi ṭhahnemngai taka in zawm chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />in ram ruahtui chu a hun takah, ruahtui tla hmasa leh ruahtui tla hnuhnûng chu ka pe ang che u a; tichuan, in buh te, in uain te, in hriak te in seng lût thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />In rante tân pawh in ramah hlobet te ka awmtîr bawk ang a, nangni pawhin in ei ang a, in tlai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Fimkhur rawh u khai; chuti lo chuan, in thinlung chu bumin a awm ang a; in pêng ang a, pathian dang rawng te in bâwl ang a, in be mai dah ang e;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />chuti a nih chuan Lalpa thin in chungah a lo thawk ang a, vân chu a khâr ang a, ruah a sûr lo vang a, lei chuan a rah a chhuah lo vang a; tichuan, Lalpa pêk che u, ram ṭha tak ata hi in boral thuai mai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chuvângin, hêng ka thûte hi in thinlung leh in rilruah khung ula, chhinchhiahna atân in bân in zem ang a; tin, in mit leh mit inkâra chal hrênna atân a awm bawk tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chûng chu in fate in zirtîr ang a, in ina in ṭhut lai te, kawnga in kal lai te, in mut lai te, in thawh hun tein in sawi ṭhîn tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, in kawngka biangah te, in kawngkhârah te in ziak tûr a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />tichuan, in pi leh pute pêk tûra chhia a chham ramah chuan in dam chhûng nî leh, in fate dam chhûng nî chu lei chunga vân nî ang khian a tisei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathian chu hmangaih tûr leh a kawng zawng zawng zawh tûr leh, amah vuan tlat tûra ṭhahnemngai taka hêng thu ka pêk che u thupêk zawng zawng hi in zawm phawt zawngin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Lalpa chuan hêng hnam zawng zawng hi a hnawh chhuahsak ang che u a, in aia ropui zâwk leh thiltithei zâwk hnamte ram chu in luah ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />In kephaha in rah apiang chu in ta a ni ang a, thlalêr aṭang leh Lebanon tlâng aṭangin lui, Euphrates lui aṭang chuan thlang lam tuifinriat thlengin in ram a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tu mah rêng rêngin an chelh lo vang che u; Lalpa in Pathianin in hnêna a sawi tawh ang khân, in va rah tûr ram zawng zawngah chuan nangmahni ṭihna leh hlauhna a awmtîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ngai teh u, vawiinah hian in hmaah malsâwmna leh ânchhia ka dah a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathian thupêkte, tûna ka pêk che u hi in zawm chuan, malsâwmna;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathian thupêkte chu in zawm lohva, in hriat ngai loh pathian dangte be tûra ka thupêk che u in pênsan erawh chuan, ânchhia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni ang a, in va luah tûr rama Lalpa in Pathianin a hruai luh che u hunah chuan, malsâwmna chu Gerizim tlângah in dah ang a, ânchhia chu Ebal tlângah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ni tlâkna piah, Araba-a awm Kanaan-ho ram, Gilgal zâwn More sasaw sîr, Jordan râla mi a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathianin a pêk che u ram va luah tûr chuan Jordan chu in kân tûr a ni a, in luah ang a, chutah chuan in awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, tûna in hmaa ka dah, dân leh rorêl zawng zawng chu zâwm tûrin in fîmkhur tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa , in pi leh pute Pathianin a pêk che u ram in luaha, leilunga in awm chhûnga fîmkhur taka in zawm tûr dân te leh rorêl dânte chu hêngte hi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />In va luah tûr ram hnamten tlâng lian te, tlâng tê te, thing hring tin hnuai tea an pathiante rawng an bâwlna hmun zawng zawng chu in tichhe vek tûr a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />an maichâmte in tichim ang a, an lungphunte in tisawm vek ang a, an Aseri-te in hâl tûr a ni; an pathian lem siam chawpte chu in kihsak ang a, chuta an hming chu in thai bo tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chutiang chuan Lalpa in Pathian chungah in ti tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathianin hnam zawng zawng zînga a hming awmna tûr hmun, a la ruat tûr chu in zawng zâwk ang a, chutah chuan in kal tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chutah chuan in hâlral thilhlan te, inthawina te, in sâwma pakhat te, in kût thên thilhlan te, in thutiam te, in duh thûa thilhlan te, in ran rual leh in berâm rual zînga piang hmasa berte in rawn la tûr a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />tin, chutah chuan Lalpa in Pathian hmaah in ei ang a, in kutkawih Lalpa in Pathianin mal a sâwmna che uah chuan hlim takin in awm tûr a ni, in chhûngkuain.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mi tinin mahni ṭha tih zâwng ang maia tûna kan tih ang hian in ti tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathianin a pêk che u ram leh chawlhna chu in la thleng rih si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jordan lui in kaia, Lalpa in Pathianin a luahtîr tûr che ua in awma, him taka in awm theihna tûra in vêla hmêlma zawng zawng laka a chawlhtîr hunah che u erawh chuan heti hi a ni ang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathianin a hming awmtîrna tûr a ruat hmuna rawn lâk tûra ka tih zawng zawng chu chutah chuan in rawn la tûr a ni, in hâlral thilhlan te, in inthawina te, in sâwma pakhat te, in kût thên thilhlan te, Lalpa hnêna in tiam ṭha ṭhate chu;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />tin, Lalpa in Pathian hmaah chuan hlim takin in awm ang, nangmahni leh in fapate, in fanute nên, in bâwihpate, in bâwihnute nên, in ina awm, Levi-hote nên, anni chuan in zîngah chanvo leh ram nei ve si hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hmun in hmuhna apiangah in hâlral thilhlante hlân mai lo tûrin fîmkhur rawh u khai;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />in hnamte zînga Lalpan a la ruat tûr hmunah chuan in hâlral thilhlante chu in hlân zâwk ang a, chutah chuan thu ka pêk zawng zawng che u chu in ti tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, Lalpa in Pathianin malsâwmna a dawntîr che u ang zêlin, in nunnain a châk ang ang chu in in ṭheuhvah in talh ang a, a sa in ei thei ang; thianghlim lote leh thianghlimte pawhin sangai te, sakhi te ang hi chu an ei thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A thisen erawh chu in ei tûr a ni lo; tui angin leiah in leihbaw tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />In inah chuan sâwma pakhat, in buh te, in uain te, in hriak te leh in ran rual leh berâm rual zînga piang hmasa ber te, in thutiama mi te, in duh thûa thilhlan te, in kût thên thilhlan te chu in ei thei lo vang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathianin hmun a la ruat tûrah, Lalpa in Pathian hmaah in ei zâwk tûr a ni, nangmahni leh in fapate leh in fanute, in bâwihpate, in bâwihnute, in khuaa awm Levi-hote nên; Lalpa in Pathian hmaah in kutkawih apiangah hlim takin in awm tûr a ni,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />In rama in awm chhûng zawng Levi-ho chu thlauthla lo tûrin fîmkhur rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathianin a tiam che u anga in ram a tihzauva, in nunnain sa ei a châk avânga, ‘Sa ka ei ang,’ in tih hunah chuan, in nunnain a châk zâwng apiang sa chu in ei thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathianin a hming awmna tûr chu in hlat luattuk chuan, thu ka pêk che u ang khân Lalpan a pêk che u in ran rual leh in berâm rual zînga mi in talh ang a, in nunnain a châk ang zâwng chu in inah in ei tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Sangai sa te, sakhi sa te in ei ang maiin in ei ang a, thianghlim lote leh thianghlimte pawhin ang khat rengin in ei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Thisen erawh chu ei lo tûrin fîmkhur rawh u; thisen chu nunna a ni si a; nunna chawpin sa chu in ei tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />In ei hauh lo tûr a ni; tui angin leiah in leihbaw mai tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />In ei tûr a ni lo; tichuan, Lalpa mit hmuha thil dik in tih hian nangmahni leh in hnua in fate tân a la ṭha dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />In thil thianghlimte leh in thutiama mite chauh keng ula, Lalpan hmun a la ruat tûrah chuan kal ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa in Pathian maichâmah in hâlral thilhlan chu, a sa leh a thisen in hlân ang a; in inthawina thisente chu Lalpa in Pathian maichâmah chuan in chhûng chhuak ang a, a sa chu in ei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hêng thu ka pêk zawng zawng che u hi ngun takin ngaichâng rawh u; tichuan, Lalpa in Pathian mit hmuha thil ṭha leh thil dik in tih hian in tân leh in hnua in fate tân kumkhuain a la ṭha dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathianin in va hneh tûr hnamte a tihbosak che ua, an ram in luaha, in khawsak hnuah chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />tihborala an awmna angah khân in awh ve lohna tûrin fîmkhur ula, ‘Hêng hnamte hian engtin nge an pathian rawng an bâwl? An tih angin keini pawhin i ti ve ang u,’ tiin, an pathiante chungchâng thûte zâwt vêl suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chutiang chuan Lalpa in Pathian chungah in ti tûr a ni lo; an pathian chungah chuan Lalpa ngaiha thil tenawm tinrêng, a huat tak maite chu an ti ṭhîn a; an fapate, an fanute ngei pawh an pathiante tân an hâl ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tih tûra thu ka pêk che u apiang chu in ti tûr a ni; in belhchhah tûr a ni lo va, in tikiam tûr a ni hek lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />In zîngah zâwlnei emaw, mang neitu emaw an lo awma, chhinchhiahna emaw, thilmak emaw an entîr che ua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />chhinchhiahna emaw, thilmak emaw an entîr che u a lo thlena, in hriat ngai loh, ‘Pathian dang i zui ang u khai, an rawng i bâwl ang u,’ in hnêna an tih chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />chu zâwlnei emaw, mang neitu emaw thûte chu in pawm tûr a ni lo; Lalpa in Pathian chuan in thinlung zawng zawng leh in nunna zawng zawngin, Lalpa in Pathian chu in hmangaih nge hmangaih lo tih hriat nân a fiah che u a ni e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathian chu in zui ang a, amah chu in ṭih ang a, a thupêkte chu in zâwm ang a, a thusawite chu in pawm ang a, a rawng te in bâwl ang a, amah chu in vuan tlat tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, chu zâwlnei emaw, mang neitu emaw chu tihhlum tûr a ni. Aigupta ram ata hruai chhuaka, bâwih ata tlantu che u, Lalpa in Pathianin zawh tûr thu a pêk che u kawng ata chu tipêng tûr che ua, Lalpa in Pathian chunga helna thu a sawi avângin. Chutiang chuan in zînga thil ṭha lo chu in tibo tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />I unaupa emaw, i fapa emaw, i nupui pawm lai emaw, i ṭhian bul emaw pawhin in thlahtute la biak ngai loh pathian dangte be tûrin an thlêm thei che u a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />in bul hnaia chêngte pathian emaw, ram hla taka chêngte pathian emaw be tûrin an râwn thei che u a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mahse, chutiang mi chuan an thlêm thlu tûr che u a ni lo, an thurâwn chu ngaithla suh ang che u. In thupin in zuah tûr a ni hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />In tihlum ngei ngei tûr a ni zâwk a; a tihlum tûrin kut i thlâk hmasa ang a, chumi hnuah mipui zawng zawngin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lungin in dêng hlum tûr a ni, Aigupta ram aṭanga bâwih ata hruai chhuaktu che u Lalpa in Pathian hnên ata tihpênna che u a zawn avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tichuan, Israel mi zawng zawngin an hria ang a, an hlau vang a, in zîngah chutiang suahsual rêng rêng chu an chîng tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathianin in awmna tûra a pêk che u in khaw pakhatah chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />in zîng ata mi dukdak lo ṭhenkhat lo chhuaka, chumi khawpuia mite chu in hriat ngai loh pathian dangte be tûrin an hruai bo tih thu sawi in hriat chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />zâwt vêl ula, zawng chhuak ula, ṭhahnemngai takin zâwt rawh u; tin, ngai teh u, thu dik a lo niha, chutiang thil tenawm in zîngah tih a ni tih hriat chian a nih chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />khandaihin chumi khuaa awmte chu in tihlum ngei ngei tûr a ni a; a chhûnga awm zawng zawng, ran rualte nên khandaihin in tiboral vek tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, râllâk sum zawng zawng chu khawlaiah in la khâwm ang a; tin, khua leh râllâk sum zawng zawng chu Lalpa in Pathian hnênah pumhâl thilhlanah in hâl ang a, lei pâwng mai a ni kumkhua ang a, din a ni leh tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Râllâk sum chu a enga mah in khawih tûr a ni lo; Lalpa chuan a thinurna nasa tak chu a lamlêt ang a, zahngaihna a hmuhtîr ang che u a, a khawngaih ang che u a, Lalpa in Pathian mit hmuha thil ṭha ti tûra thupêk zawng zawng, tûna ka pêk che u hi, in zawm phawt chuan a tipung dâwn che u nia, in pi pute hnêna chhia a lo chham tawh ang khân.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathian fate in ni a; mitthi avângin in inzai tûr a ni lo va, in mit hmul in mêt kâwng tûr a ni hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathian tân hnam thianghlim in ni si a, leilunga hnam zawng zawng zînga a pual bîk ni tûra Lalpan a thlan che u in ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thil tenawm rêng rêng in ei tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hêng sate hi a ni in ei theih tûr chu: bâwngpa te, berâm te, kêl te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />sakhi te, sangai te, sakhipa te, sathâr te, ram kêl te, ram lâwi te, ram berâm te hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, sa tinrêng, tin kâka tin kâk chhuak, chaw ṭhial nawn chi tawh phawt zînga mi chu in ei thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, hêng chaw pawh ṭhial nawn si, an tin pawh kâk site hi chu in ei tûr a ni lo: sanghâwngsei te, zupui te, sazupui te hi; chaw chu an ṭhial nawn na a, an tin a kâk loh avângin in tân a bawlhhlawh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, vawk hi a tin chu a kâk na a, chaw a ṭhial nawn loh avângin in tân a bawlhhlawh a ni; a sa in ei tûr a ni lo va, a ruang pawh in khawih tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuia chêng zawng zawngah hêngte hi in ei thei ang: pângparh leh phuhlip nei tawh phawt chu in ei thei ang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />pângparh leh phuhlip nei lo apiang chu in ei thei lo vang, in tân a bawlhhlawh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Sava thianghlim zawng zawng chu in ei thei ang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hêngte erawh hi chu in ei tûr a ni lo: mupui te, lungdûp te, muarla te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />mulukawlh tê te, ngawihûp te, mute chi rêng rêng te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />choâk chi rêng rêng te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />sava sâng te, vabak te, tuifinriat sava te, mu chi rêng rêng te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />hrângkir te, chhimbuk te, chingpirinu te, chhimbuksialki te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />tuivalawng te, mulukawlh te, lui dung mû te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />kânghlai te, dîl sava chi rêng rêng te, chhuangtuar leh bâkte.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Thla nei, kea kal chi zawng zawng chu in tân thil bawlhhlawh a ni a, in ei tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sava thianghlim zawng zawng chu in ei thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amaha thi chu eng mah in ei tûr a ni lo; in awmpui ram dang mite ei atân in pe thei ang a, hnam dang mite hnênah in hralh thei bawk ang; nangni zawng Lalpa in Pathian tâna hnam thianghlim in ni si a. Kêlnotê chu a pui hnutêin in chhûm tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kum tin in lova thlai haw zawng zawng sâwma pakhat in tîl hrang ngei ngei tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathian ṭih nachâng in lo hriat fo theih nân sâwma pakhat, in buh te, in uain te, in hriak te leh in bâwng rual leh in berâm rual zînga piang hmasa berte chu Lalpa in Pathian hmaah, a hming awmna tûra a la ruat tûrah chuan in ei tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathianin mal a sâwm hun che ua, Lalpa in Pathianin a hming awmna tûr a la ruat tûr chu, a hlat lutuk avânga in tân kawng a thui luattuka in ken theih loh chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />pawisaah in chantîr ang a, pawisa chu in keng ang a, Lalpa in Pathian hmun ruatah chuan in kal tûr a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />tin, pawisa chu in rilrua in duh ber, bâwngpa emaw, berâm emaw, uain emaw, zupui emaw, in rilrua in châk zâwng ang apiang atân in hmang ang a; chutah chuan Lalpa in Pathian hmaah in ei ang a, hlim takin in awm tûr a ni, nangni leh in chhûngte nên;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Levi-ho in awmnaa awmte chu thlauthla hauh suh ang che u; in zîngah chanvo pawh, rochan pawh an nei ve si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Kum thum a vei kum apiangin, chumi kuma in thil hâwng zawng zawnga sâwma pakhat chu in la khâwm vek ang a, in awmnaah in dah tûr a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />tin, in awmnaa awm Levi-ho pawh, in zînga chanvo, rochan pawh nei ve lote leh ram dang mite leh pa nei lote leh hmeithaite chuan an ei ang a, an lo khawsa ve thei ang; tichuan, Lalpa in Pathianin in kutkawih zawng zawngah chuan mal a sâwm dâwn che u nia.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, kum sarih a vei kum apiangin ngaihdamna in siam tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ngaihdam dân chu hetiang hi a ni: leiba neitu apiangin an ṭhenawmte an lo pûktîr chu an ngaidam tûr a ni; a ṭhenawm pawh, a unau pawh a ṭhîng lui tûr a ni lo, Lalpa ngaihdamna chu puan a nih tawh avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hnam dang mi chu in ṭhîng lui thei ang a; amaherawhchu, in ta eng pawh in unaute lo hman chu in ngaidam tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hêng thupêk, tûna ka thupêk zawng zawng che u hi, pawm tûra Lalpa in Pathian aw chu ṭhahnemngai taka in zawm phawt chuan, mi rethei rêng rêng in awm hauh lo vang a (Lalpa in Pathianin luah tûra a pêk che u ramah chuan, Lalpan mal a sâwm ngei ngei dâwn che u a ni);
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathian chuan a tiam che u angin mal a sâwm ang che u a, hnam tam tak in pûktîr ang a, nangni erawh chuan in pûk lo vang; hnam tam tak chungah ro in rêl ang a, in chungah erawh chuan ro an rêl ve lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lalpan ram a pêk che u in awmnaah in unaute zîngah rethei an awm chuan, in unau retheite lakah chuan in rilru tikhauh suh ula, kawm hek suh u,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />an lakah chuan in thilphal ngei ngei tûr a ni a, an tlâkchhamnaa an mamawh phuhrûkna khawp in pûktîr tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />‘Ngaihdam kum, kum sarihna chu a lo thleng dâwn ta,’ tiin, in unau retheite chu hmu mawha eng mah pe duh lovin, in thinlungah dik lo taka ngaihtuahna awm lo tûrin fîmkhur rawh u; chuti lo chuan, ani chuan i chungchâng thûah Lalpa a au vang a, in tân sual a lo ni dah ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />In pe ngei ngei tûr a ni a; tin, in pêk hunah pawh in thinlung a hnûr hauh lo tûr a ni; chutiang thil avâng chuan a ni, Lalpa in Pathianin in thiltih zawng zawngah leh, in kutkawih zawng zawngah mal a sâwm dâwn che u ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chu ramah chuan mi retheite awm loh lai a awm dâwn si lo va; chuvângin, ‘In rama in unaute chungah te, tlachhamte chungah te, in mi retheite chungah te in thilphal ngei ngei tûr a ni,’ tiin thu ka pe che u a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />In unau, Hebrai pa emaw, Hebrai nu emaw, in hnêna an hralha, kum ruk in rawng an bâwl chuan, kum sarih kum chuan in chhuahtîr tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, in chhuahtîr hun chuan kutbêngin in chhuahtîr tûr a ni lo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />in berâm ruala mi te, in hruiha mi te, in uain sâwr khura mi te ui lo takin in pe tûr a ni; Lalpa in Pathianin mal a sâwm dân che u ang zêlin in pe tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aigupta ramah khân bâwih in ni tawh a, Lalpa in Pathianin a tlan che u tih kha in hre reng tûr a ni; chuvâng chuan a ni, tûnah hian hêng thu hi ka pêk che u ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni ang a, nangmahni leh in chhûngkua an ngainat avâng leh in intihthiam avânga in hnêna, ‘Ka chhuahsan lo vang che u,’ an tih tlat chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />thîr zum in la ang a, kawngkhâr chhanah an beng in vit ang a; tichuan, kumkhuain in bâwih an ni ang. Tin, in bâwihnu pawh chutiang bawk chuan in ti tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chhuahtîr chu thil harah in ngai tûr a ni lo. Inhlawhfa thawh leh hnih thawkin kum ruk in rawng an bâwlsak tawh si che u a; tin, Lalpa in Pathianin in thiltih apiangah mal a sâwm zêl ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />In ran rual te, in berâm rualte zînga a pa, piang hmasa ber apiangte chu Lalpa in Pathian pualah in pe tûr a ni; in bâwngpa piang hmasa ber chu hnathawkah in chhawr tûr a ni lo va, in berâm rualte zînga piang hmasa ber hmul chu in mêt tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathian hmaah kum tinin Lalpan hmun a la ruat tûrah chuan in ei tûr a ni, nangni leh in chhûngte nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Sawisêl kaina nei, a ke bai emaw, a mit del emaw, sawisêl kaina nei tawh phawt chu Lalpa in Pathian hnêna inthawi nân in hmang tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nangmahni awm hmunah in ei tûr a ni; thianghlim lote leh thianghlimte pawhin hêng sangai te, sakhi te ang hi chu in ei thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A thisen erawh chu in ei hauh lo tûr a ni; tui angin leiah in leihbaw mai tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Abib thla chu thla serhah nei ula, Lalpa in Pathian tâna Kalhlên Kût nân hmang rawh u: Abib thla hian a ni, Lalpa in Pathian chuan Aigupta ram ata zânah a hruai chhuah che u ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpan a hming awmna a la ruat tûrah chuan, Lalpa in Pathian hnênah in berâm rual zînga mi leh ran rual zînga miin, Kalhlên Kûtah in inthawi tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chhang dawidim telh nên in ei tûr a ni lo; in dam chhûng zawnga Aigupta ram ata in chhuah nî chu in hriat reng theih nân ni sarih chhang dawidim telh loh, hrehawmna chhang nên in ei tûr a ni, Aigupta ram aṭang chuan hmanhmawh taka chhuak in nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />In ram chhûngah ni sarih chhûng chu dawidim rêng rêng a awm tûr a ni lo va; tin, ni khat nî tlai lama in inthawina sa chu zankhuain a tûk zîng thlengin eng mah a awm tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathianin a pêk che u in awmna khawiah mah Kalhlên Kût inthawiin in inthawi thei lo vang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathianin a hming awmna a la ruat tûrah chauh chuan a ni ang; chutah chuan Aigupta ram ata in lo chhuah hun ang tlai lamah, ni tlâkah Kalhlên Kût inthawiin in inthawi tûr a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, in rawh ang a, Lalpan hmun a la ruat tûrah chuan in ei ang a; tin, zîngah in haw leh ang a, in puan inah in kal tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ni ruk chhûng chu chhang dawidim telh loh in ei tûr a ni; tin, a ni sarih nî chu Lalpa in Pathian tân inkhâwmpui thianghlim a ni ang a, hna in thawk tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chawlhkâr sarih in chhût ang a; in buh seng ṭan nî aṭangin chawlhkâr sarih chu in chhût tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathianin mal a sâwm che u ang zêlin, in deh chhuah zînga mi mahni duh thûa thilhlan chu hlânin, Lalpa in Pathian tan chawlhkâr kût in nei tûr a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />tin, Lalpa in Pathianin a hming awmna a la ruat tûrah chuan nangni nên, in fapa te, in fanu te, in bâwihpa te, in bâwihnu te, in awmnaa awm Levi-ho te, in zînga awm ram dang mi te, pa nei lo te, hmeithaite nên Lalpa in Pathian hmaah hlim takin in awm ang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Aigupta ramah khân bâwih in ni tih in hre reng tûr a ni a; tin, hêng dânte hi fîmkhur takin in zâwm tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />In hrui ata leh in uain sâwr khur ata in chhêk khâwm zawhah, ni sarih chhûng bâwkte kût in nei tûr a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />in kûtah chuan nangni nên, in fapa te, in fanu te, in bâwihpa te, in bâwihnu te, in awmnaa awm Levi-ho te, ram dang mi te, pa nei lo te, hmeithaite nên hlim takin in awm tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lalpan hmun a la ruat tûrah chuan Lalpa in Pathian tân ni sarih in kût tûr a ni; Lalpa in Pathianin in thil haw zawng zawngah leh in kutkawih zawng zawngahte mal a sâwm ang che u a, lâwm tak hlîrin in awm dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kum tin in mipa zawng zawngte chu vawi thum Lalpa hmaah, hmun a la ruat tûrah chuan an inlan tûr a ni: chhang dawidim telh loh kûtah te, chawlhkâr kûtah te, bâwkte kûtah te; tin, Lalpa hmaah tu mah kutruakin in inlan tûr a ni lo va,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathianin malsâwmna a dawntîr che u ang zêlin mi tinin an theih ang tâwk an pe tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathianin a pêk che u in kulh kawngka zawng zawngah, in hnam ang zêlin, rorêltute leh hotute in insiam ṭheuh vang a, mipuite ro fel takin an rêlsak tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Dik lo takin ro in rêl tûr a ni lo; tu mah duhsak bîk in nei tûr a ni lo; thilpêk in la tûr a ni hek lo; thilpêk chuan mi fingte mit a tihdelsak a, mi felte thu a tihkhawlohsak si ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathianin a pêk che u ram chu nungdama in luah theih nân a fel chauhva chu in zâwm tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathian maichâm in la siam tûr sîrah chuan thing eng chi mahin Aseri in din tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathianin a huat zâwng lung pawh in phun tûr a ni hek lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawngpa emaw, berâm emaw, sawisêl kai leh ṭhat lohna nei rêng rêng chuan Lalpa in Pathian hnênah in inthawi tûr a ni lo; chu chu Lalpa in Pathian tân thil tenawm a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />In zîngah Lalpa in Pathianin a pêk che u in awmna khawiah pawh mipa emaw, hmeichhia emaw pawh, thuthlung bawhchhiaa pathian dang rawng va bâwla, ka thupêk loh, nî emaw, thla emaw, vâna mi rêng rêng biaa, Lalpa in Pathian mit hmuha thil ṭha lo ti an awma,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />an hrilh chia, nangin i lo hriata, ṭhahnemngai taka in zawha, tin, ngai teh, a lo dika, thu a chian chiaha chutiang thil tenawm Israel-te zînga tih a lo nih chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />chu thil sual titu, mipa emaw, hmeichhia emaw chu in kulh kawngkhâr pâwnah, mipa emaw, hmeichhia emaw ngei chu in hruai chhuak ang a, lungin in dêng hlum tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hretu pahnih emaw, pathum emaw kâ aṭangin thi tûra chu tihhlum tûr a ni a, hretu pakhat kâ aṭang chuan tihhlum tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tihhlumna tûrah chuan hretute chuan kut an thlâk hmasa ang a, chumi hnuah mipui zawng zawngin. Chutiang chuan in zîng ata chu thil ṭha lo chu in tibo tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thisen inchhuah thûah te, sum leh pai thûah te, invuak thûah te, in awmnaa inkhinna thu rêng rêngtea in tâna rêl harsa lutuk a lo awm chuan, Lalpa in Pathianin hmun a la ruat tûrah chuan in kal ang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />chumi huna puithiam Levi-hote leh rorêltute hnênah chuan in kal ang a, in râwn ang a; tin, annin thu tihthlûk dân an lo kawhhmuh dâwn che u nia;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />tichuan, nangnin Lalpan hmun a la ruat tûr aṭanga thu tihthlûk dân an lo kawhhmuh che u ang chuan in ti ang a, an zirtîr che u ang zêlin fîmkhur takin in ti dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thu tihthlûk dân an lo zirtîr che u leh rorêl dân an lo hrilh che u ang zêl chuan in ti ang a; thu tihthlûk dân an lo kawhhmuh che u chu ding lamah emaw, vei lamah emaw in pênsan tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathian hmaa rawngbâwla ṭang ṭhîn puithiam leh rorêltu thu pawm lova, tilui apiang, chu mi chu tihhlum tûr a ni. Israel zîng ata, chu thil ṭha lo chu in tibo tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tichuan, mi zawng zawngin an hria ang a, an hlau vang a, an tilui leh tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathianin ram a pêk che u in va thlena, in va luaha, in va awma, ‘Kan vêla hnam zawng zawngte ang bawkin lal i nei ang u,’ in tih hunah chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathianin a thlana ngei chu lalah in nei tûr a ni a; in unau zînga mi pakhat in lalah in siam tûr a ni; hnam dang mi, in unau ni lo chu nangmahni awptu atân in siam tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, sakawr a ngah tûr a ni lo vang a, sakawr a ngah theih nân Aigupta rama mite nên chuan inthurual tûr a ni bawk hek lo; Lalpa chuan, ‘Tûn achinah chuan chumi lamah chuan in lêt leh tawh tûr a ni lo,’ in hnênah a ti tawh tlat si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A rilru a vah bo loh nân nupui pawh a ngah tûr a ni lo va, tangkarua leh rangkachak pawh a ngah tûr a ni hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni ang a, a ram lalṭhutthlênga a ṭhut hun chuan puithiam Levi-hote kawl ṭhin dân hi lehkhabuah a ziak chhâwntîr ang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />a kawl ang a, a dam chhûng zawng a chhiar ṭhîn tûr a ni, hêng dân leh hêng thuruat zawng zawng hi pawma, zâwma, ti tûra Lalpa a Pathian ṭih dân a zir theiha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />a rilru a unaute chungah a dah lohva, ding lamah emaw, vei lamah emaw thupêk chu a pênsan lohna tûr leh, Israel-te zînga amah leh a thlahte a ramah hian an dam rei phah nân a chhiar ṭhîn tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Puithiam Levi-ho, Levi hnam zawng zawng chuan Israel-te zîngah chanvo leh rochan an nei tûr a ni lo va; Lalpa hnêna meia thilhlan leh a puala mi an ei tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />An unaute zîngah rochan chu an nei tûr a ni lo; an rochan chu an hnêna a sawi angin Lalpa a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Inthawina hlântu mipuite laka puithiam pual tûr chu hêng hi a ni ang: bâwngpa pawh, berâm pawh, a dâr leh a bekbawr khinghnih leh a pumpui puithiam an pe tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />In buhbâl te, in uain te, in hriak haw hmasa te, in berâm hmul meh hmasak ber te in pe bawk tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathianin Lalpa hminga rawngbâwla awm kumkhua tûrin, in hnam zawng zawng zîng ata a thlan an ni si a, anmahni leh an fapate nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Levi mi tu pawh a awmna Israel ram, in awmna a khawii pawh chhuahsana, a rilrua châk taka Lalpan a la ruat tûr hmunah a lo kal chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />chuta Lalpa hmaa awm ṭhîn Levi-ho, a unaute ang bawkin Lalpa a Pathian hmingin rawng a bâwl tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />An puithiam man tiam lovin, mi dang pual ang ei tûr chu an chang ve tho vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathianin a pêk che u ram in va thlen hun chuan, chûng hnamte thil tenawm tih ang chu in chîng ve tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A fapa emaw, a fanu emaw meia kal tlangtîr te, aien chîng te, ṭhumvâwr chîng te emaw, mitlâkdawi hmang emaw te, dawithiam te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />dawi ât te, ramhuaizâwl rawih te, dawithiam te, mitthi biak chîng mite in zîngah an awm tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hêng thil ti mi apiangte hi Lalpa ngaihin mi tenawm an ni si a; tin, hêng thil tenawm avâng hian a ni, Lalpa in Pathianin a hnawh chhuahsak che u ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathian hmaah in ṭha famkim tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chûng in va luah tûr rama hnamte chuan ṭhumvâwr leh aien chîngte an pawm ṭhîn a; nangni zawng Lalpa in Pathianin chutiang tih chu a phal lo a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathianin keimah ang hi in unaute zînga mi zâwlnei a siamsak ang che u. A thu chu in ngai tûr a ni,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />‘ Lalpa kan Pathian aw chu min hriattîr tawh suh la, he mei nasa tak hi min hmuhtîr leh tawh suh la, kan thi dah ang e,’ tia Horeb tlânga pun khâwm nîa Lalpa in Pathian in duh dân ang khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan ka hnênah, ‘An thusawi chu an sawi ṭha hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />An unaute zînga nangmah ang zâwlnei ka siamsak a; a kâah ka thûte ka dah ang a, a hnêna thu ka pêk apiang chu an hnênah a sawi ang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni ang a, ka hminga ka thu a sawi pawm lo apiang chu ka ngaihtuah ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka hminga sawi tûr ka pêk loh sawi luitu zâwlnei emaw, pathian dangte hminga thusawitu zâwlnei emaw, chu zâwlnei chu tihhlum tûr a ni,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, in thinlunga, ‘Engtin nge thu chu Lalpa sawi a ni lo tih kan hriat ang?’ in tih chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />zâwlneiin Lalpa hminga thu a sawia, a thil sawi chu a thlen lohva, a hlawhtlin loh chuan, chu chu a ni Lalpa sawi loh va chu; zâwlnei chuan uangthuang takin an sawi mai mai a ni, amah chu in hlau tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathianin an ram a pêk che u hnam Lalpan a tihbova, in luaha, an khuaah te, an inah te in awm hunah chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathianin luah tûra a pêk che u, in ramah chuan in tân khaw pathum in ruat tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualthat apiang an tlân luhna tûrin, Lalpan a luahtîr tûr che u ram chu hmun thumah in ṭhen ang a, in ramrite in siam ang a, kawngte in buatsaih tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, tual that chuta tlân lûta him theite chu hêngte hi an ni: mi a ṭhenawm khawvêng tûn hma lama huatna pawh nei lêm lova that palh apiangte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />mi a ṭhenawm khawvêng nên thing kit tûra ram kala, thing kit tûra a hrei han chêka, hreifang thlawnin ṭhenawm khawvêng chu vawm hlum ta ang te hi, chumi zînga khaw pakhatah chuan a tlân ang a, a him ang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />thisen phuba latu chuan a thinur lin laia tualthattu chu a ûma, kawng a thui avânga ûmphâkin a va vaw hlum hlauh dah ang e; tûn hma lama huatna te lo nei lêm lo a nih avângin thi âwm a ni si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chuvângin, ‘Khaw pathum in tân in ruat tûr a ni,’ tiin thu ka pe che u a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa in Pathianin in pi leh pute hnêna chhia a lo chham anga in pi leh pute pêk a lo tiam ram chu a pêk che ua, Lalpa in Pathian chu hmangaih tûr leh a kawng zawh fo tûra a thupêk zawng zawng, tûna thu ka pêk che u hi in pawma, in ram chu a tihzau chuan hemi khaw pathum tiam lovin in tân khaw pathum dang in belhchhah leh ang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lalpan luah tûra a pêk che u in ram chhûngah chuan pawi khawih lo thisen chhuah a awm lohva, in chunga thisen a awm loh nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, miin a ṭhenawm khawvêng a huata, a châna, a beiha, thi khawp hiala a vuaka, chumi khaw zînga pakhata a tlân chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />an khaw upaten mi tîr sela, chuta ta chu va hruai sela, tihhlum tûrin thisen phuba latu kutah hlân rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />In khawngaih tûr a ni lo va, in tâna ṭha tûrin Israel ram ata pawi khawih lo thisen chhuahna chu in tibo tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathianin luah tûra a pêk che u ram, in luah tûr rama a hmaa an lo phun tawh in ṭhenawm ramri chu in sawn tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mi a khawlohna emaw, a sualna rêng rêng emaw hretu pakhat chu a tâwk lo vang; hretu pahnih kâ emaw, hretu pathum kâ emawa thuin tihngheh tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hretu fel lo takin mi thil tidik lova a puh chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />an inkhinnaah an pahnihin Lalpa hmaah chumi huna puithiamte leh rorêltute hmaah chuan an ding tûr a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />tin, rorêltute chuan ngun takin an dap ang a; tin, ngai teh, thuhretu chu hretu der a niha, a unau chu dâwta puh a nih chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />a unau chunga tih a lo tum ang chuan a chungah in ti tûr a ni; chutiang chuan in zînga thil ṭha lo chu in tibo tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A la awmhote chuan an hria ang a, an hlau vang a, tûn hnuah chutiang thil ṭha lo rêng rêng chu in zîngah an ti tawh dâwn lo nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />In khawngaih tûr a ni lo va: nun aiah nun, mit aiah mit, ha aiah ha, kut aiah kut, ke aiah ke a ni ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />In hmêlmate do tûra in chhuaha, sakawr te, tawlailîr te, mipuite in aia tam in hmuhin, anmahni chu in hlau tûr a ni lo; Aigupta ram ata hruai chhuaktu che u Lalpa in Pathian chu in hnênah a awm si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, in indo dâwn hnaih chuan puithiam chuan mipuite chu va pan sela, bia sela,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />an hnênah, ‘Aw Israel-te u, hre rawh u khai, tûnah chuan in hmêlmate in do dâwn ta a ni a, zâm suh ula, ṭih suh ula, khûr hek suh u, anni chu hlau hek suh u;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />nangmahni chhandam tûra in hmêlmate beihsak tûr che ua in hnêna awm zêl chu Lalpa in Pathian a ni si a,’ ti rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, hotute chuan mipuite hnênah, ‘In thar saa la hlân lo in awm em? A inah haw leh rawh se, indonaah a va thi hlauh ang a, mi dangin an hlân dah ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, grêp huan siama, a rah la chhawr lo in awm em? A in lamah haw leh rawh se, indonaah a thi hlauh vang a, mi dangin an chhawr dah ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, nupui huala la nei lo in awm em? A in lamah haw leh rawh se, indonaah a thi hlauh vang a, mi dangin an nei dah ang e,’ tiin sawi rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, hotute chuan mipuite hnênah, ‘Hlau leh zâm in awm em? A in lamah haw rawh se, a unaute thinlung chu a thinlung angin a tuiral ve dah ang e,’ lo ti zêl rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni ang a, hotuten mipuite hnêna thu an sawi zawh chuan mipuite hmahruaitu tûr sipai hotute an ruat tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bei tûra khua in va hnaih hun chuan remna thu han sawi phawt ula.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni ang a, an lo rem che ua, an lo inpêk chuan heti hi a ni ang a, chuta mi awm zawng zawng chu hnathawka in rawih tûr an ni ang a, in rawng an bâwl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, an lo rem duh loh che ua, an lo do dâwn che u chuan in hual ang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />tin, Lalpa in Pathianin in kuta a pêk hun che u chuan, chuta mipa zawng zawng chu khandaihin in tihlum vek tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hmeichhia leh an fanau tê tête, rante leh khuaa thil awm rêng rêngte erawh chu chuta râllâk thil zawng zawng nên lam in pualah in la tûr a ni; tin, Lalpa in Pathianin a pêk che u in hmêlmate laka râllâk thil chu in chên tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hêng hnamho khuate ni lo, in awmna aṭanga khaw hla zawng zawng chu chutiang chuan in ti zêl tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathianin luah tûra a pêk che u hêng hnam khuate erawh hi chu, Lalpa in Pathianin thu a pêk che u angin, nung tawh phawt chu eng mah in zuah tûr a ni lo va,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hit mi te, Amor mi te, Kanaan mi te, Periz mi te, Hiv mi te, Jebus mi te chu in tiboral vek tûr a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />an pathiante chunga an tih ṭhin thil tenawm zawng zawng chu an zirtîr lohna tûr che uin; chuti lo chuan, Lalpa in Pathian chungah thil in tisual dah ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lâk tuma in beiha, khua chu rei tak in hual pawhin chûnga thingte chu hreipuiin in kit tûr a ni lo; in ei atân a ni a, in kit tûr a ni lo. Thing chu mihring em an niha in hual ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A rah ei loh mi thing a ni tih in hriatte erawh zawng in tichhiain in kit ang a, dotu che u khua chu a chhiat hma loh chuan kulhin in hung hnan tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathianin luah tûra a pêk che u ramah hian tâmlakah mi, tihhlumin lo awm ang sela, a tihlumtu hriat ni si lo sela,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />in upate leh in rorêltute an lo kal ang a, an tihhlumna vêl khua aṭang chuan an teh ang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />tin, heti hi a ni ang a, a ruang aṭanga khaw hnai ber, chumi khaw upate chuan bâwng rual zînga bâwnglâ, la chhawr loh, nghâwngkawl la bel loh an kai ang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />tin, chu khaw upate chuan bâwnglâ chu tui luanna, lei la leh loh leh eng mah la chîn lohna ruamah an kai chhuk ang a, ruamah chuan bâwngla ring chu an tan ang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />tin, Levia fapa puithiamten an rawn pan ang a, anni chu Lalpa in Pathianin a rawngbâwltu leh Lalpa hminga malsâwmtu atân a ruatte an ni si a; thubuai leh invuak thu chu an rêl ang ang a ni ang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />tin, ruang hnaih ber khaw upate zawng zawng chuan ruama bâwngla ring an tan chungah chuan an kut an sil ang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />‘Kan kutin he thisen hi a chhuah lo va, kan mitin a hmu bawk hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aw Lalpa, i tlan chhuah i mi Israel-hote hi ngaidam la, i mi Israel-hote zîngah hian pawi khawih lo thisen chhuahna hi a awm phal suh ang che,’ an ti ang a, an ṭang tûr a ni. Tichuan, thisen thûah chuan ngaihdam an ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chutiang chuan Lalpa mit hmuha thil ṭha tiin pawi khawih lo thisen chhuahna chu in tikiang tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />In hmêlmate rûn tûra in kal chhuaha, Lalpa in Pathianin in kuta a pêk che ua, sala in hruaia,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />sal zînga hmeichhe hmêl ṭha tak, in mi duh zâwng tak, nupui atâna in mi duh zâwng tak in hmuh chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />in inah in hruai hâwng ang a, a lû a mêt ang a, a tin a zai ang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />a sal kawr chu a hlîp ang a, in inah a awm ang a, thla khat zet a nu leh a pa a sûn ang a, chumi hnuah chuan i pâwl ang a, a pasal i ni ang a, i nupui a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, i lung a dum loh chuan a duh duhnaah a kal i phal tûr a ni, sum leh paiah i hralh hauh tûr a ni lo va, sal bâwlin i bâwl tur a ni lo, i tihminghliau tawh si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Miin nupui pahnih nei ang sela, pakhat chu duhin pakhat chu hua sela, a duha leh a huata chuan fa hrinsak ve ve sela; tin, fapa upa ber chu a huata fa ni sela,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />a ro neih chu a fapate a khâwmtîr hunah chuan a duh taka fapa chu a fapa upa, a huata fa aia û-ah a siam tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, a huata fa, a fa upa ber chu a neih zawng zawnga chan hnih huiah a siam tûr a ni; a chakna bul a ni a, fa tîr nihna chu a pual a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Miin fapa luhlul tak, hel hmang tak nei ang sela, a nu leh a pa thu âwih lovin, an thununna pawm duh lo sela,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />a nu leh a pa chuan an kai ang a, an khaw upate hnênah an khaw kulh kawngka bulah an hruai tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, an khaw upate hnênah chuan, ‘He kan fapa hi luhlul tak leh hel hmang tak a ni a, kan thu pawh a âwih duh lo va; inkhawhral hmang leh ruih hmang mi a ni,’ an ti tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tichuan, khuaa mi zawng zawng chuan lungin an dêng hlum tûr a ni; chutiang chuan in zîng ata, chu thil ṭha lo chu in tibo tûr a ni; tin, Israel mi zawng zawngin an hria ang a, an hlau vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, miin thihna khawp sual a tiha, tihhlum a niha thinglêra in khai chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />a ruang chu thingah chuan zankhuain a awm tûr a ni lo va, chumi nî la la chuan in phûm tûr a ni; thinga khai apiang chu Pathian ânchhe dawng a ni si a; Lalpa in Pathianin luah tûra a pêk che u in ram chu in tihbawlhhlawh loh nân.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />In unaute bâwngpa emaw, an berâm emaw bo chu in hmuhin in ngawihsan mai tûr a ni lo va, in unaute inah in hruai hawsak leh ngei tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, in unaute chu in kiang hnaia awm an nih lohva, a neitu chu in hriat loh emaw a nih chuan, in in lamah in hruai haw ang a, in hnênah a awm reng ang a, in unauvin a rawn zawn hun hunah in lo pe leh tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />An sabengtung pawh chutiang bawk chuan in ti tûr a ni a, chutiang bawk chuan an silhfênte pawh in ti tûr a ni a, chutiang bawk chuan in unau thil hloh in chhar tawh phawt chu in ti tûr a ni a, in ngawih bopui tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />In unaute sabengtung emaw, an bâwngpa emaw, kawnga tlu in hmuhin in ngawihsan mai tûr a ni lo va, in tun thawhpui ngei tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hmeichhiain mipa thuamhnaw an inbel tûr a ni lo va, mipain hmeichhe silhfên an inbel tûr a ni hek lo; tu pawh chutiang ti apiang chu Lalpa in Pathian ngaihin mi tenawm an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kalkawnga thingah emaw, leiah emaw sava bu, a puiin a no emaw, a tui emaw awm a awp lai in hmuh chuan a no chu a pui chawpin in la tûr a ni lo va,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />a pui chu chhuah ngei ngei tûr a ni a, a no erawh chu in la thei ang; chutichuan, in tân a ṭha ang a, in dam rei dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />In thar in sak chuan, chuta mi an tlâka in in chu thisen chhuahna in a nih loh nân, in in chung in hung tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, in grêp huanah thil chi hnih in chîng tûr a ni lo; chuti lo chuan, in chi tuh leh in grêp huana thil hâwng zawng zawng chu Lalpa pual a ni mai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bâwngpa leh sabengtung lei in leh duntîr tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Sahmul leh la tah pawlh in inbel tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />In intuamna puan chu a tlâng paliah fêm in neihtîr tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Miin nupui a neiha, a pâwla, a huat leh sia,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />‘He hmeichhia hi ka nei a, ka han pâwl a, nula thianghlim a nihna ka hmu lo va,’ tia mualpho taka a siama, a hming a tihchhiat chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />nula nu leh pa chuan kulh kawngkaah chumi khaw upate hnênah nula thianghlim a nihna chu an rawn tilang tûr a ni a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />tin, nula pa chuan upate hnênah, ‘He mi hi ka fanu ka neihtîr a, a haw leh si a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />tin, ngai teh u, “I fanu hi nula thianghlim a nihna ka hmu lo ve,” tiin mualpho takin a siam a; mahse, hêngte hi ka fanu nula thianghlim a nihna chu a ni alâwm,’ a ti ang a. Tichuan, chumi khaw upate hmaah chuan puan an phah ang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, chu khaw upate chuan chu mi chu an hrem ang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Israel nula thianghlim a tihhmingchhiat avângin tangkarua sekel za an chawitîr ang a, nula pa chu an pe tûr a ni. Ani chu a nupui a ni ang a, a dam chhûngin a ṭhen thei lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, chumi thu chu a lo dika, nula chu nula thianghlim a nihna a lan loh chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />nula chu a pa kawngkaah an hruai chhuak ang a, a awmna khuaa mite chuan lungin an dêng hlum ang, a pa ina nawhchizuara Israel-te zînga thil sual âtthlâk tak a tih avângin. Chutiang chuan in zîng ata, chu thil ṭha lo chu in tibo tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Miin pasal nei a mutpui an hmuh chuan an pahnih chuan an thi tûr a ni, a mutpuitu mipa leh hmeichhia chu; chutiang chuan Israel zîng ata, chu thil ṭha lo chu in tibo tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nula thianghlim, mi nupui hual, miin khuaah a hmuha, a mutpui chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />an pahnihin khaw kulh kawngkaah in hruai chhuak ang a, lungin in dêng hlum tûr a ni; hmeichhia chu khuaa awm sia, a au loh avângin; tin, mipa chu a ṭhenawm nupui a tihhminghliau avângin; chutiang chuan in zîng ata, chu thil ṭha lo chu in tibo tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, miin ramhnuaiah nula, mi hual a hmuha, a tihluiha a mutpui chuan, a mutpuitu mipa chauh chu tihhlum tûr a ni a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />a nula chu eng mah in tih tûr a ni lo, nula chungah chuan thihna khawp sual a awm lo; hetiang hi chu, mi a ṭhenawm beia that ang a ni a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />ramah a va tawng fuh a, mi hual nula chu a au va, chhantu an awm si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Miin nula thianghlim, hual loh a hmuha, a mana, a mutpui an hmuh chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />a mutpuitu mipa chuan nula pa chu tangkarua sekel sawmnga a pe tûr a ni a; tin, ani chu a nupui a ni ang, a tihhminghliau tawh avângin; a dam chhûngin a ṭhen thei lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />“Tu mân mahni pate nupui mutpuiin an pate an timualpho tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mi, a tilmu keh leh a zahmawh tan chu Lalpa mite pung khâwm zîngah an tel tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sâwn chu Lalpa mite pung khâwm zîngah an tel tûr a ni lo; chhuan sâwmna thlengin a thlahte chu Lalpa mite pung khâwm zîngah an tel tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amon mite leh Moab mite chu Lalpa mite pung khâwm zîngah an tel tûr a ni lo. Chhuan sâwmna thlengin an zînga mi chu Lalpa mite pung khâwm zîngah an tel hauh lo tûr a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aigupta ram aṭanga in lo chhuah laia chhang leh tuia an lo hmuah loh che u avâng leh, ânchhe lawh tûr che ua Mesopotamia rama Pethor khuaa Beora fapa Balaama an rawih avâng khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nimahsela, Lalpa in Pathian chuan Balaama thu chu a pawm duh lo va, Lalpa in Pathian chuan a hmangaih che u avângin, Lalpa in Pathian chuan ânchhia chu in tân malsâwmnaah a chantîr ta zâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />In dam chhûng zawng anmahni nêna inremna leh an hmuingîlna eng tikah mah in ngaihtuahpui tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Edom mite chu in lungten tûr a ni lo, in unaute an ni si a; Aigupta mite chu in lungten tûr a ni lo, an ramah chuan in va mikhual tawh avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />An thlahte chu chhuan thumna aṭangin Lalpa mite pung khâwm zîngah chuan an tel tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />In hmêlmate beia in va riahna hmunah chuan thil ṭha lo tinrêng lakah in inthiarfihlîm tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />In zîngah tu pawh zâna amaha thil chhuak avânga bawlhhlawh an awm chuan, riahhmun ata a chhuak ang a, riahhmunah chuan a lût leh tûr a ni lo va;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />amaherawhchu, khua a lo tlai lamin a inbual ang a; tin, ni tlâkah riahhmunah a lût leh tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, riahhmun pâwn lamah hmun in ruat ang a, chutah chuan in kal ṭhîn tûr a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />tin, in hmanraw zîngah chuan suahdûr in nei ang a; tin, heti hi a ni ang a, chu chuan in va ṭhutna tûr chu in lai khuar ang a, in zunram thiar chu in vûr leh tûr a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathian chu in riahhmunah nangmahni chhan him tûr leh, in hmêlmate hlân tûr che uin a lo tel zêl si ṭhîn a; chuvângin, in riahhmun chu a thianghlim tûr a ni; chuti lo chuan, in zînga thil bawlhhlawh a hmu ang a, a kal bosan dah ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chhiahhlawh, in hnêna a pu rawn tlân chhuahsan chu a pu hnênah in pe lêt leh tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />In awmnaa a duh ber a thlan apiangah chuan in zîngah a awm ve mai tûr a ni; in hnehchhiah tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Israela fanute zîngah nawhchizuar an awm tûr a ni lo va, Israela fapate zîngah mipa inzuar an awm tûr a ni hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nawhchizawrh man emaw, uicho man emaw, thutiam nân Lalpa in Pathian inah in keng tûr a ni lo; a eng ve ve pawh chu Lalpa in Pathian ngaihin thil tenawm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A pung ûmin in unaute in pûktîr tûr a ni lo; tangka lama pung emaw, ei tûr lama pung emaw, eng pawh a pung ûma pûktîr rêng rêng chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ram dang mite chu a pung ûmin in pûktîr thei ang; nimahsela, in unaute chu a pung ûmin in pûktîr tûr a ni lo; chutichuan, in va luah tûr rama in kutkawih zawng zawngah Lalpa in Pathianin mal a sâwm dâwn che u nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathian hnêna thu in tiamin, rei rial lovin pêk nghâl tûr a ni; Lalpa in Pathian chuan a phût dâwn ngei si che u a, in tân sual a lo ni mai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Thutiam kawnga in insûm chuan in tân sual a ni lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />In kâa chhuak tawh chu in ti ngei tûr a ni; duh thûa thilhlan in kâa in tiam, Lalpa in Pathian hnêna in tiam ang zêlin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />In ṭhenawm grêp huana in kalin, in duhtâwkin in ei thei a; amaherawhchu, in êmah in khung tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />In ṭhenawm buh ding lai hmuna in kalin, a vui chu in thliak thei a; amaherawhchu, in ṭhenawm buh ding laiah chuan favah in ruai tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Miin nupui a neiha, a chunga thil mawi lo eng emaw a hriat avânga a mit a tlun loh chuan heti hi a ni ang a, inmâkna lehkha a ziaksak ang a, a pe ang a, a in ata a chhuahtîr tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, a in ata a chhuah hnu chuan mi dang a va nei thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, a pasal hnuhnûng zâwk chuan a huata, inmâkna lehkha a ziaksaka, a pêka, a in ata a chhuahtîr emaw, a pasal hnuhnûng zâwk, nupuia neitu chu a thi emaw a nih chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />a pasal hmasa, amah kaltîrtu khân, tibawlhhlawh tawh a ni a, a nei leh thei lo vang; Lalpa ngaihin tenawm a ni, Lalpan luah tûra a pêk che u ramah chuan sual in luhtîr tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi, nupui nei hlim chu sipaiah a kal tûr a ni lo va, eng hna thawkah mah phût tûr a ni lo; a in lamah kum khat chu a duh ang angin a awm ang a, a nupui nên hlim takin an awm tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Buh râwt sawmna emaw, a chung lam lung emaw tu mah in hrênsak tûr a ni lo, mi nunna hrênsak in ni dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tu pawh, Israela thlah, a unaute zînga mi rû a, sal deha dek emaw, zuar emaw hriat chhuah an nih chuan, chu rûkrupa chu tihhlum tûr a ni; chutiang chuan in zîng ata, chu thil ṭha lo chu in tibo tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Phâr hri chungchâng thûah chuan, ngun taka dap chhuaka, puithiam, Levi-hote zirtîr dân ang zêla ti tûrin fîmkhur rawh u; anmahni thu ka pêk angin fîmkhur takin in ti tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aigupta ram ata in lo chhuahna kawnga Lalpa in Pathianin Miriami chunga a tih dân kha hre reng rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Eng pawh in ṭhenawm in pûktîrin, a hrêng la tûrin a inah in lût tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pâwnah in ding ang a, in pûktîra chuan hrêng chu pâwnah a rawn lâksak tûr che u a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi rethei a nih chuan a hrêng chu in mutpui tûr a ni lo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />a silhfênah chuan a muta, a fak theih nân che u a hrêng chu ni tlâkah in pe kîr leh ngei tûr a ni; tichuan, Lalpa in Pathian ngaihin in tân thil fel a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />In mi rawih, mi rethei leh tlachhamte chu in unau emaw, in ram, in awmnaa awm ram dang mi emaw pawh ni sela, in hnehchhiah tûr a ni lo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />a thawh ni chuan a hlawh chu in pe tûr a ni a, niin a tlâk hnan tûr a ni lo; mi rethei a ni a, chutah chuan a rilru a dah ṭhîn a ni; chuti lo chuan, in chungchâng thûah Lalpa a au vang a, in tân sual a lo ni dah ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Fate avângin pate tihhlum tûr a ni lo va, pate avângin fate tihhlum tûr a ni hek lo; mi tin mahni sual avâng ṭheuhva tihhlum tûr an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ram dang mite leh pa nei lote ro chu dik lo takin in rêlsak tûr a ni lo va, hmeithai puan chu hrêngah in lâksak tûr a ni hek lo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />nangni pawh Aigupta ramah khân bâwih in ni tawh a, Lalpa in Pathianin chuta ta chu a tlan che u a ni tih in hre reng tûr a ni; chuvâng chuan a ni hêng thil hi ti tûra thu ka pêk che u ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />In lova buh in senga, buhphal in khâwm hmaih chuan in la leh tûr a ni lo, ram dang mi te, pa nei lo te, hmeithaite ta tûr a ni; tichuan, Lalpa in Pathian chuan in kutkawih zawng zawngah mal a sâwm dâwn che u nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />In olive thing in vuakin a zârte chu in vaw nawn tûr a ni lo; ram dang mi te, pa nei lo te, hmeithaite ta tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />In grêp, huana mi in lawhin a ṭo in zawng tûr a ni lo; ram dang mi te, pa nei lo te, hmeithaite ta tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, Aigupta ramah khân bâwih in ni tawh tih in hre reng tûr a ni; chuvâng chuan a ni, hêng thil hi ti tûra thu ka pêk che u ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mi an inkhin chuan, rorêlnaah an kal ang a, rorêltuten an lo rêlsak ang a, mi fel chu thiam an chantîr ang a, mi sual chu thiam loh an chantîr tûr a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />tin, heti hi a ni ang a, mi sual chu vuak âwm a nih chuan, rorêltu chuan a muttîr ang a, a hmaah a vuaktîr tûr a ni, a sual dân azirin vuak zat tûr chu thliah a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Vawi sawmli thlenga vuak theih a ni ang a, chu aia chuangliam chu ni lovin; hei aia chuanga a vuak chuan in unaupa chu in mualpho lu dah ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sebâwngpain buh a chîl laiin a hmui in phuar tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Unauza awm ho sela, fapa nei lovin an zînga mi chu thi sela, a thia nupui chuan pâwn lama mi, mi dang a nei tûr a ni lo; a pasal unau chuan a rochung ang a, nupuiah a nei ang a, pasal unau tih tûr chu a chungah a ti tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni ang a, a fa tîr hrinsak chuan Israel zînga a hming a bo loh nân a unau thi taa hming chu a pu tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan a unaupa nupui chu neih a duh loh chuan, a unaupa nupui chu kulh kawngkaa upate hnênah a han chho vang a, ‘Ka pasala unaupain Israel zîngah a unau hming awmtîr zêl a duh lo va, pasal unaupa tih tûr chu ka chungah a ti duh lo,’ a han ti tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chutichuan, an khaw upate chuan ani chu an ko vang a, an bia ang a; tin, ani chuan, ‘Ka nei duh lo a ni,’ tia a ṭan tlat chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />a unaupa nupui chuan upate hmaah a han pan ang a, a pheikhawk a hlihsak ang a, a hmaiah chil a chhâk ang a, ‘A unaupa chhûngkaw din duh lotu chungah chuan hetianga tih ni zêl rawh se,’ a ti ang a, a chhâng tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tichuan, ‘Chhûngkaw pheikhawk hlihsaka’ tiin Israel-te zîngah chuan a hming puttîr tûr a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mi insual sela, a pakhat zâwka nupui chuan a sualpui lak ata a pasal chhan chhuak tûrin a zahmawhah pawhsak sela,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />a kut chu in tansak tûr a ni a, in khawngaih tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />In ipah chuan khîn chi dang dang, a rit leh a zâng in nei tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />In inah tehna chi dang dang, a lian leh a tê in kawl tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Khîn dik tak leh fel tak in nei tûr a ni. Tehna dik tak leh fel tak in nei tûr a ni si; tichuan, Lalpan ram a pêk che uah hian in dam rei dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chutiang thil titu, fel lo taka titu zawng zawng chu Lalpa in Pathian ngaihin tenawm an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aigupta ram ata in lo chhuahna kawnga Amalek-ho lo tih dân che u kha hre reng rawh u;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pathian pawh hlau lovin in chauh lai leh in ngui laia kawnga an lo tawh che ua, in zînga hnufual mi chhiaṭhaho a hnufualte zawng an lo beih dân te kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chuvângin, heti hi a ni ang a, Lalpa in Pathianin luah tûra ram a pêk hun che ua, in vêla in hmêlmate zawng zawng laka Lalpa in Pathianin râlmuanna a pêk hun che u chuan, vân hnuai chhîna Amalek-ho hriat rengna chu in tibo hlauh tûr a ni; in theihnghilh hauh tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni ang a, Lalpa in Pathianin rochun leh luah tûra ram a pêk che u in va luha, in va awm hun chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathianin a pêk che u in ram leilung rah haw hmasa ber ṭheuhte chu in rawn la ang a; bâwmah in dah ang a, Lalpa in Pathianin a hming awmtîrna tûra a la ruat tûrah chuan in kal tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, chumi huna puithiam hnênah chuan in kal ang a, a hnênah, ‘Min pêk tûra kan pi leh pute hnêna chhia a lo chham ramah kan lo kal ta tih, vawiinah hian Lalpa in Pathian hnênah kan tilang a ni,’ in ti ang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, puithiam chuan in kut ata bâwm chu a la ang a, Lalpa in Pathian maichâm bulah a hûng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, nangnin Lalpa in Pathian hmaah chuan, ‘Kan pu chu Suria mi, mi vâkvai a ni a, Aigupta ramah a zuk chhuk a, a zuk chêng a, tlêm tê an ni a; tin, chutah chuan hnam ropui tak, thiltithei tak, tam tak an lo ni ta a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />tin, Aigupta mite chuan min tinawmnah a, min tirethei a, hna hautak tak min thawhtîr a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />tichuan, Lalpa kan pi leh pute Pathian chu kan au va, Lalpa chuan kan aw chu a lo hria a, kan retheihzia te, kan rimzia te, hnehchhiah kan nihziate chu a hria a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />tin, Lalpa chuan Aigupta ram ata chu kut chak tak te, bân phar te, thil hlauhawm tak te, chhinchhiahna te, thilmaktein min hruai chhuak a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />he hmunah hian min hruai lût a, he ram, hnute tui leh khawizu luanna ram hi min pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, ngai teh, aw Lalpa , nangin min pêk leilung rah hmasa ber ṭheuhte kan rawn la e,’ in va ti tûr a ni. Tin, Lalpa in Pathian hmaah chuan in hûng ang a, Lalpa in Pathian hmaah chibai bûkin in kûn ang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />tin, Lalpa in Pathianin in chhûngkua te, nangni te, Levi mi te, in zînga ram dang mite thil ṭha a pêk zawng zawng che uah chuan hlim takin in awm tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, kum thum kum, sâwma pakhat pêk kuma in thil hâwng zawng zawng sâwma pakhat in pêk zawh chuan, Levi mi te, ram dang mi te, pa nei lo te, hmeithaiten in awmnaah chuan an eia, an lo khawsak ve theihna tûrin in pe tûr a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />tin, Lalpa in Pathian hmaah, ‘I thu min pêk, i thupêk zawng zawng angin kan in ata thil thianghlimte chu kan dah chhuak a, Levi mi te, ram dang mi te, pa nei lo te, hmeithai te kan pe tawh a; i thupêk chu a enga mah kan bawhchhe lo va, kan theihnghilh hek lo va;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />kan lusûn laiin chuta mi chu kan ei lo va, kan bawlhhlawh laiin kan thehthang hek lo va, mitthi pualah kan pe hek lo; Lalpa kan Pathian aw chu kan ngaichâng a, i thu min pêk zawng zawng ang chuan kan ti a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />I awmna thianghlim vân aṭang chuan rawn en la, hnute tui leh khawizu luanna ram, kan pi leh pute pêk tûra chhia i lo chham tawh ang khân i mi Israel-te leh i leilung min pêk hi malsâwm ang che,’ in ti tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Vawiinah hian Lalpa in Pathian chuan hêng dân leh rorêlte hi zâwm tûrin thu a pe che u a ni; chuvângin, in thinlung zawng zawng leh in rilru zawng zawngin in pawmin in zâwm tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Vawiinah hian Lalpa chu a kawngte zawha, a dânte, a thupêkte leh a rorêlte zâwma a awte ngaihchân tumin in Pathianah in thlang ta a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />tin, vawiinah hian a tiam che u ang khân, a thupêk zawng zawngte in zawma, ama pual bîk ni tûr leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />a lo sawi tawh anga Lalpa in Pathian tân mi thianghlim in nih theihna tûr leh, hnam a siam zawng zawng zînga fak te, hmingṭhat te, chawimawi te hlawh tûrin Lalpan a thlang che u a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Mosia leh Israel upate chuan mipuite chu, “Thupêk zawng zawng vawiina ka pêk che u hi pawm rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathianin ram a pêk che ua kal tûra Jordan in kân ni chuan heti hi a ni ang a, lung lian tak tak in phun ang a, lung chârna in hnawih tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />In kai hnuin a chungah chuan he dân thu zawng zawng hi in ziak tûr a ni; tichuan, Lalpa , in pi leh pute Pathianin a lo tiam che u ang khân hnute tui leh khawizu luanna ram, Lalpa in Pathianin a pêk che u ramah chuan in kal thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Jordan lui in kân zawh chuan heti hi a ni ang a, vawiina thu ka pêk che u ang hian Ebal tlângah lungte chu in phun ang a, lung chârna in hnawih tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, chutah chuan Lalpa in Pathian tân maichâm, lung maichâm in siam tûr a ni a, thîr hmanrua in hmang tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathian maichâm chu lung chher lohvin in siam tûr a ni a; chumiah chuan Lalpa in Pathian tân hâlral thilhlante in hlân ang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />remna thilhlantein in inthawi ang a, chutah chuan in ei ang a, Lalpa in Pathian hmaah chuan hlim takin in awm tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, lung chungahte chuan he dân thu zawng zawng hi fiah takin in ziak tûr a ni,” tiin thu an pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Mosia leh puithiam Levi-hote chuan Israel mi zawng zawng chu an bia a, “Aw Israel mite u, ngun takin ngaithla rawh u; vawiinah hian Lalpa in Pathian mite in lo ni ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa in Pathian thu chu in âwih tûr a ni a, vawiina thu ka pêk che u, a thupêkte leh a dânte chu in zâwm tûr a ni,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, chumi nî vêk chuan Mosian mipuite chu thu a pe a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Jordan lui râl in kai hnu chuan mipuite malsâwm tûrin Gerizim tlângah hêngho hi an ding tûr a ni: Simeon hnam te, Levi hnam te, Juda hnam te, Isakar hnam te, Josef hnam te, Benjamin hnamte hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />tin, ânchhe lawh tûrin hêngho hi Ebal tlângah an ding tûr a ni: Reuben hnam te, Gad hnam te, Aser hnam te, Zebulun hnam te, Dan hnam te, Napthali hnamte hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Levi-hote chuan an han sawi ṭan ang a, Israel mi zawng zawng hnênah chuan aw ring takin:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />‘Themthiamte kutchhuak Lalpa tâna tenawm milem din chawp emaw, chhûn chawp emaw vawng ru apiang chu ânchhe dawngin awm rawh se,’ an ti ang a. Tin, mipui zawng zawng chuan, ‘Amen!’ an lo ti ang a, an lo chhâwn tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />‘A nu emaw, a pa emaw zah lo apiang chu ânchhe dawngin awm rawh se,’ an ti ang a. Tin, mipui zawng zawng chuan, ‘Amen!’ an lo ti tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />‘A ṭhenawm ramri sawntu chu ânchhe dawngin awm rawh se,’ an ti ang a. Tin, mipui zawng zawng chuan, ‘Amen!’ an lo ti tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />‘Kawng ata mitdel kawng lova kaltîrtu chu ânchhe dawngin awm rawh se,’ an ti ang a. Mipui zawng zawng chuan, ‘Amen!’ an lo ti tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />‘Ram dang mi te, pa nei lo te, hmeithai te ro dik lo taka rêlsaktu chu ânchhe dawngin awm rawh se,’ an ti ang a. Mipui zawng zawng chuan, ‘Amen!’ an lo ti tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />‘A pa nupui mutpuitu chu ânchhe dawngin awm rawh se, a pa timualpho a nih avângin,’ an ti ang a. Mipui zawng zawng chuan, ‘Amen!’ an lo ti tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />‘Ran eng pawh pâwltu chu ânchhe dawngin awm rawh se,’ an ti ang a. Mipui zawng zawng chuan, ‘Amen!’ an lo ti tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />‘A farnu, a pa fanu emaw, a nu fanu emaw mutpuitu chu ânchhe dawngin awm rawh se,’ an ti ang a. Mipui zawng zawng chuan ‘Amen!’ an lo ti tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />‘A pizawn mutpuitu chu ânchhe dawngin awm rawh se,’ an ti ang a. Mipui zawng zawng chuan ‘Amen!’ an lo ti tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />‘A ṭhenawm that rutu chu ânchhe dawngin awm rawh se,’ an ti ang a. Mipui zawng zawng chuan, ‘Amen!’ an lo ti tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />‘Pawi khawih lo thah nâna thamna latu chu ânchhe dawngin awm rawh se,’ an ti ang a. Mipui zawng zawng chuan, ‘Amen!’ an lo ti tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />‘He dân thu pawm nghehpui lotu chu ânchhe dawngin awm rawh se,’ an ti ang a. Mipui zawng zawngin, ‘Amen!’ an lo ti tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a lo la ni ang a, Lalpa in Pathian awkâ chu ngun taka in ngaihthlâka, vawiina thu ka pêk che u thupêk zawng zawng fîmkhur taka in zawm chuan, Lalpa in Pathian chuan khawvêl hnam zawng zawnga chungnung berah a siam ang che u;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />tin, Lalpa in Pathian thu in pawm phawt chuan hêng malsâwmna zawng zawng hi in chungah a lo awm ang a, a zui zêl ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />In lam leh ram lamahte chuan malsâwmin in awm ang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />In rîla rah te, in lei rah te, in ran rual pung, in bâwngpui leh in berâm rual pungte chu malsâwmin a awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />In bâwm leh in chhang hmehna thlêngte malsâwmin a awm ang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />In chhuakvâk te chu malsâwmin in awm ang a, in lo hâwng te pawh malsâwmin in awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />In hmêlma, nangmahni beitute chu Lalpan a tihtlâwmsak ang che u a; a bei tûr che uin kawng khatah an lo lût ang a, kawng sarihah an tlânchhia ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lalpan in buh in chungah te, in kutkawih zawng zawng chungahte malsâwmna thu a pe ang a; Lalpa in Pathianin ram a pêk che uah chuan mal a sâwm ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />In hnêna chhia a lo chham tawh angin, Lalpa chuan ama tâna hnam thianghlimah a tinghet ang che u, Lalpa in Pathian thupêkte in zawma, a kawngte in zawh phawt chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tichuan, khawvêl hnam tinin Lalpa ta in nih an hria ang a, an hlau vang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, nangmahni pêk tûra in pi leh pute Lalpan a lo tiam ramah chuan in rîla rahah te, in ran rualah te, in lei rahahte Lalpan nasa takin a tipung ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lalpa chuan a hun taka in ram châwm tûr ruahtui pe tûr che u leh, in kutkawih zawng zawng malsâwm tûrin vân, a ro bâwm ṭha chu, a hawnsak ang che u a; tichuan, hnam tam tak in pûktîr ang a, nangni erawh chuan in pûk lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan mei ni lovin lûah a siam ang che u a, a hnuaihnung ni lovin a chungnung zêl in ni ang; Lalpa in Pathian thupêk awiha, tûna ka pêk che u hi fîmkhur taka pawma, vawiina thu ka pêk che u,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />a thûte hi a enga mah, ding lam emaw, vei lam emawa pathian dangte zui leh rawngbâwl tûra in pênsan loh phawt chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, heti hi a lo la ni ang a, Lalpa in Pathian awkâ chu ngun taka in ngaihthlâk lohva, vawiina thu ka pêk che u thupêk zawng zawngte hi fîmkhur taka in zawm loh chuan, hêng ânchhia zawng zawngte hi in chungah a lo awm ang a, a nangchîng ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />In lam leh ram lamahte chuan ânchhia in dawng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />In bâwm leh in chhang hmehna thlêngte chu ânchhe dawngin a awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />In rîla rah te, in lei rah te, in bâwngpui leh in berâm rual pungte chu ânchhe dawngin an awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />In vâk chhuak te chu ânchhe dawngin in awm ang a, in lo hâwng te pawh ânchhe dawngin in awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lalpan in chungah, in kutkawih zawng zawngah ânchhia te, buaina te, zilhhauna te a rawn tîr ang a, in tlâwm ang a, in boral thuai ang; in thil tihsualte avânga mi hnuchhawn avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Luah tûra in luhna ram ata chu a tihboral hma loh che u chuan Lalpan hri a vawntîr tlat ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Lalpan ngawrna te, khawsik te, vûnna te, sat huam huamna te, khandaih te, rona te, ṭawihnatein a hrem ang che u a, in boral hma loh chuan a ûm zêl ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />In chung lama in vân chu dâr a ni ang a, in hnuai lama lei chu thîr a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />In ram ruah chu vaivut leh vaivut khu-ah Lalpan a chantîr ang a; in boral hma loh chu vân aṭangin in chungah a lo tla ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Lalpan in hmêlmate lakah a titlâwm ang che u a; anmahni bei tûrin kawng khatah in chhuak ang a, kawng sarihah in tlânchhia ang a; khawvêl hnam tin zîngah kil tin kil tangah in vâk in vâk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />In ruang chu chunglêng sava zawng zawng leh ramsa zawng zawng chaw a ni ang a, a hnawt botu an awm hauh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tihdam theih loh Aigupta khawihli te, ngâwtna te, vûnna te, uithaktein Lalpan a hrem ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Âtna te, mitdelna te, zâmnatein Lalpan a hrem ang che u a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />mitdelin thimthama a dap a dap angin chhûn ênah pawh in dap in dap ang a, in khawsak thûah chuan in hmuingîl lo vang; tin, hnehchhiah atân leh râllâk atân ngawt in ni châmchî ang a, chhan chhuak tûr che u tu mah an awm lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Nupui in hual ang a, mi dangin an mutpui ang; in in sa ang a, in luah lo vang; grêp huan in siam ang a, a rah chu in chhawr lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />In mit hmuhah in bâwngpate chu thah a ni ang a, a sa chu in ei lo vang; in sabengtungte chu an lâk luihsak ang che u a, an pe leh lo vang che u; in berâmte chu in hmêlmate pêk a ni ang; chhantu che u tu mah in nei lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />In fanute, in fapate chu hnam dangte pêk an ni ang a, nilêngin anmahni ngaiin in thlîr reng ṭhîn ang a; in thlîrna lamah in mitte a chau vang a, eng mah tih theih in nei si lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />In lei rahte leh in thawh rim rahte chu in hriat loh hnamin an ei zo vang a, hnehchhiah atân leh nêksâwr atân ngawt in ni châmchî ang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />chutichuan, chûng thil chu in hmuhin in ât phah ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Lalpan in khûpah te, in keah te, tihdam theih loh khawihli na chi a veitîr ang che u, in kephah aṭanga in chhîp thlengin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Nangmahni leh in lal chawpin in pi leh pute chena in hriat ngai loh hnam hnênah Lalpa chuan a hruai ang che u a; chutah chuan pathian dang, thing leh lung rawng te in bâwl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tichuan, Lalpan a la hruai bona tûr che u hnam zawng zawng zîngah chuan mak tih leh hau bûr leh a chhe lama tehkhinna in lo la ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Lovah buh chi tam tak in feh chhuahpui ang a; tlêm tê chauh in seng ang, khauvin a ei zo vek dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Grêp huan in siam ang a, in enkawl ang a; nimahsela, a uain chu in in lo vang a, grêp chu in lo hek lo vang, changpâtin a ei zo dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />In ram zawng zawngah olive thing in chîng ang a; nimahsela, a hriak chu in thih lo vang, in olive rahte chu a hlamtla zo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Fanu fapa in hring ang a; nimahsela, in ta an ni lo vang, salah an la hruai dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />In thei kûng zawng zawng leh in lei rah chu khau chan a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Ram dang mi, in zînga awmte chuan an sân khalh telh telh ang che u a, nangni chu in hnuai telh telh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />An pûktîr ang che u a, nangni chuan in pûktîr ve lo vang. Anni chu lû an ni ang a, nangni chu mei in ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Hêng ânchhia zawng zawng hi in chungah a lo awm ang a, a ûm ang che u a, a nangchîng ang che u, a tihboral zawh thleng che uin; a thupêkte leh a dân a pêk che u zâwm tûra Lalpa in Pathian awkâ chu in ngaihthlâk loh avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />In chungah leh in thlahte chungah kumkhuaa chhinchhiahna leh mak tih atân a la awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Thil engkima in lo muk pawha Lalpa in Pathian chu rilru lâwm tak leh hlim taka a rawng in bâwl loh avângin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />nangmahni bei tûra Lalpan a la rawn tirh tûr in hmêlmate rawng chu rilṭâm chung te, tuihâl chung te, saruak chung te, thil engkim tlachham chungtein in bâwl ang a; an tihboral hma loh che u chuan in nghâwngah thîr nghâwngkawl an bât ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Hla tak aṭangin kâwlkil ata nangmahni bei tûr hnam, Lalpan mupui bir angin a rawn tîr ang; an ṭawng in hriat loh hnam;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />upate pawh pawisa lo leh ṭhalaite pawh duhsak chuang lo hnam kawlhsen tak chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Tin, in ran rual pung te, in lei rah te, in boral hma loh zawng an ei ang a, buh te, uain te, hriak te, in bâwng pung te, in berâm rual note an zuahsak lo vang che u, in boralna an thlensak thleng che uin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />In ram zawng zawnga in rinpui, in kulh sângte a chim thlengin in kulh kawngka zawng zawngah an hual ang che u a, Lalpa in Pathianin a pêk che u in ram zawng zawnga in kulh kawngka zawng zawngah an hual ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />In hmêlmaten an dan chêpna che u avângin an hualna che u leh an dan chêpnaah che u chuan in rîla rah, Lalpan a pêk che u in fanute leh in fapate sa in ei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />In zînga mi nun tluang, mi tlang takte pawhin an unaupa te, an nupui duh tak te, an la awmpui an fanaute takngial pawh an hmu mawh ang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />eng mah an neih tawh loh avângin an fate sa an ei tûr chu a tuate mah an pe lo vang; an hualna che u leh an dan chêpna che u avangin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />In zînga hmeichhe awm no leh chhiaṭhate, an chhiaṭhat leh an awm no avânga lei pawh rap duh lote chuan an pasal duh tak te, an fanu te, an fapa te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />an pawm lai fa sên leh an fa la piang tûrte pawh an hmu mawh ang a; engkim an tlâkchham tawh avângin a rûkin an ei ang; an hualna che u leh an dan chêpna che u, in hmêlmaten in kulh kawngkaa an dan chêpna che u avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathian hming ropui tak leh hlauhawm tak hi, in hlauh theihna tûra he lehkhabua chuang thu zawng zawng hi fîmkhur taka in zawm loh chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Lalpan nangmahni leh in thlahte chungah hri mak tak, hripui lêng reng, natna hrehawm tak lêng reng chi a lêntîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />In hlauh hle ṭhin Aigupta ram hrite kha in chungah a lêntîr leh ang a, a vuan tlat ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />He dân lehkhabua chuang lo, natna leh hri tinrêng pawh in boral hma loh chu Lalpan in chungah a lêntîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Vâna arsi zât ni ṭhînte kha tlêm tê chauh in lo ni tawh ang, Lalpa in Pathian awkâ chu in zawm loh avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni ang a, a tiṭha tûr che u leh a tipung tûr che ua Lalpa chu a lâwm ang khân, a tiboral tûr che u leh a tichhe tûr che uin Lalpa chu a lâwm ang a, in va luah tûr in luhna ram ata chu sawn bo in ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan kâwlkil aṭanga kâwlkil lehlam thlengin chi tin zîngah a tidarh ang che u a, chutah chuan thing leh lung - in pi leh pute chena in hriat ngai loh pathian dangte rawng in bâwl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />Chûng hnam zîngah chuan hahdamna rêng rêng in hmu lo vang a, in ke tân chawlhna rêng rêng a awm lo vang a; chutah chuan Lalpan khurhna rilru te, mit chauhna te, nguina rilrute a pe zâwk ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />In nunna chu hlauthâwng rêng rêngin a awm ang a, chhûn leh zân hlau rengin in awm ang a, in nunnain ngaihngam taka awm a nei lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" />Zîng lamah chuan, ‘Tlai ni tawh sela aw!’ in ti ang a, tlai lamah chuan, ‘Zîng ni tawh sela aw!’ in ti ang; thil hlauhawm in thinlungin a hlauh tûr avâng leh in mita in thil hmuh tûr avâng chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" />‘In hmu leh tawh lo vang,’ in hnêna ka tih kawngah chuan lawngin Aigupta ramah Lalpan a hruai leh ang che u; tin, chutah chuan in hmêlmate bâwihpa atân te, bâwihnu atân te in inzuar ang a, tu mân an duh dâwn lo che u a ni,” tiin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Horeb tlânga an hnêna thu a thlun tiam lova, Lalpan Moab rama Israela thlahte hnêna Mosia thu a thluntîr, a thuthlung thûte chu hêng hi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tichuan, Mosian Israel mi zawng zawng chu a ko va, an hnênah, “Aigupta rama Pharaoa chungah te, a mite zawng zawng chungah te, a ram zawng zawng chungah te in mit hmuh ngeia Lalpan thil a tih zawng zawng kha in hmu a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />fiahna nasa tak te, chhinchhiahna te, thilmak te in mit ngeia in hmuh kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nimahsela, Lalpan vawiin thleng hian hriat thiamna thinlung te, hmuh theihna mit te, hriat theihna beng te a la pe lo che u a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thlalêrah kum sawmli ka hruai ta che u a; in silhfênte chu in sin chul lo va, in pheikhawkte chu in bun chul lo bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kei hi Lalpa in Pathian ka ni tih in hriat theih nân chhang in ei lo va, uain pawh, zupui pawh in in lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, he hmun in lo thlen hian, Hesbon lal Sihona leh Basan lal Oga chu min do tûrin an lo thawk a, anni chu kan lo hneh a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />tin, an ram chu kan la a, Reuben-ho te, Gad-ho te, Manase hnam zâtvete luah atân kan pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chutichuan, in thiltih zawng zawnga in hmuingil zêl theih nân he thuthlung thûte hi pawm ula, zâwm rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tûnah hian in zain - in hnam puipa te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />in upa te, in hotu te leh Israel mi dang zawng zawng, in fanau tê tê te, in nupui te, in awmpui ram dang mi, in thing kittu leh in tui chawitute chenin Lalpa hmaah in ding a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathianin in pawm tûra thuthlung a siamah hian vawiinah in lût dâwn ta a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />in thlahtu Abrahama te, Isaaka te, Jakoba te hnênah leh in hnêna a lo tiam tawh anga in Pathian a nih theih nân, ama mi atân a tinghet che u a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />He chhechham leh thuthlung thu hi in hnênah chauh thlung ka ni lo va,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />vawiina Lalpa kan Pathian hmaa dingte leh tûna kan hnêna awm ve lote hnênah pawh hian a ni
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />(Aigupta rama kan awm dân te, hnam dangte tâwn tlanga in kal tlang dânte in hria a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />an zînga an thil tenawmte leh an milem, thing leh lung te, tangkarua leh rangkachakte in hmu bawk a).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chuti lo chuan, in zînga mipa emaw, hmeichhia emaw, chhûngkua emaw, hnam emaw, chûng hnam pathiante be tûr chuan an thinlungin tûnah hian Lalpa kan Pathian chu hawisanin, in zîngah thil khâ leh sai chawr chhuahna bul te in lo awm dah ang e;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />tin, chuti a nih zawngin he chhechham thu hi hre reng sia, luhlul taka duh ang anga a awm pawha a tân eng mah pawi lo tûr anga mahni inthlamuan chawp chu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />chutiang mi chu Lalpan a ngaidam dâwn hauh lo va, Lalpa thinurna leh a thîkna chuan chu mi chu a ur ang a, he lehkhabua ânchhe chuang zawng zawng hi a chungah a awm ang a, Lalpan vân hnuai ata a hming chu a thai bo zâwk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />He dân bua chuang ânchhe thuthlung zawng zawng ang hian, Israel hnam zawng zawng zîng ata tihrangin thil ṭha lo lamah Lalpan a teltîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, ṭhangthar lo la awm tûr, in hnua in fate lo la awm tûr leh, ram dang mi hla tak aṭanga lo kal tûrte chuan, chumi rama hri leh Lalpan natna a veitîrte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />a ram pum pui chu kât leh chi leh kâng hlum, eng mah chîn lohna, eng mah chawr lohna, hlobette pawh chawr lohna, Sodom leh Gomorra leh Adma leh Zeboiim tihchhiat, Lalpan thinur leh thinrima a tihchhiat anga chhia a nih an hmuh hun chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />hnam tinin, ‘Eng vângin nge he ram hi hetianga Lalpan a tih? He thinur ling nasa tak hi eng tizia nge ni?’ an ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chutichuan, miin, ‘Aigupta ram ata a hruai chhuah laia a thuthlun, Lalpa an pi leh pute Pathian thuthlung chu an hawisana,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />pathian dang, an hriat ngai loh pathiante, anin a ruatsak ni lote rawng an bâwla, an biak vâng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Chuvâng chuan he lehkhabua chuang ânchhia zawng zawng thlentîr tûrin he ram chungah hian Lalpa thin a thawk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, thinrim leh thinur leh thinrim tak maiin an ram ata a pawt chhuak vek a, ram dangah a theh lût a ni, tûna an awm dân ang hian,’ an ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Thil inthupte chu Lalpa kan Pathian ta a ni a; thil tihlante erawh chu, he a dân thu zawng zawng hi kan zawm theih nân keini leh kan thlahte ta kumkhua tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan a hnawh darhna che u hnam dang zînga in awm laia, in chungah hêng tûna malsâwmna leh ânchhia in hnêna ka sawi hi a lo thlenin, duh thlan tûr in neih hi hre reng ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathian lam in hawi leha, tûna thu ka pêk che u ang hian, nangni leh in fate nên, in thinlung zawng zawng leh in rilru zawng zawnga a awkâ in zawm hunah chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathianin in sal nihna a tibo vang a, a khawngaih ang che u a, Lalpa in Pathianin hnam tin zînga a tihdarhna che u ata a hruai khâwm leh ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />In zînga mi, vân tawp thlenga hnawh chhuah an awm chuan, Lalpa in Pathianin chuta ta chu a hruai khâwm ang che u a, chuta ta chu a hruai chhuak ang che u;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />tin, Lalpa in Pathianin in pi leh puten an luah ramah khân a hruai lût leh ang che u a, in luah ang a; ani chuan a tihmuingîl ang che u a, in pi leh pute khûmin a tipung ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, in nun theihna tûra Lalpa in Pathian chu in thinlung zawng zawng leh, in rilru zawng zawnga in hmangaih theihna tûrin, Lalpa in Pathianin in thinlung leh in thlahte thinlung serh a tansak ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa in Pathianin hêng ânchhia zawng zawng hi a tiduhdahtu che u, in hmêlmate leh a hawtu che u chungah a awmtîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, in lo hawi leh ang a, Lalpa awkâ hi in pawm ang a, vawiina thu ka pêk che u, a thupêk zawng zawngte hi in zâwm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa in Pathian chuan in kutkawih zawng zawngah te, in rîla rahah te, in bâwng rual pungah te, in lei rahahte nasa takin a tipung ang che u a, in pi leh pute chunga a lâwm ang khân in chungah Lalpa a lâwm leh ang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />he dân bua chuang a thupêkte, a dânte zâwm tûra Lalpa awkâ in zawma, in thinlung zawng zawng leh in rilru zawng zawnga Lalpa in Pathian lam in hawi phawt chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />He thupêk, tûna ka pêk che u hi in tân a har lutuk lo va, a hlat lo bawk che u a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />‘Kan hriata kan zawm theihna tûrin tu nge vânah min kalsak ang a, min han lâksak ang?’ tih tûrin vâna mi a ni lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />‘Kan hriata kan zawm theihna tûrin tuifinriat râlah tu nge min kalsak ang a, min rawn lâksak ang?’ tih tûrin tuifinriat râla mi a ni hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />In zawm theih nân thu chuan a hnaih hle che u a, in kâah leh in thinlungah a awm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tûnah hian in hmaah nunna leh ṭhatna, thihna leh thil ṭha lo ka dah a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathian hmangaih tûr te, a kawng zawh tûr te, a thupêk te, a dân te, a rorêlte pawm tûra tûna thu ka pêk che u hi in zawm chuan nungdamin in awm ang a, in lo pung ang a, in va luah tûr ramah chuan Lalpa in Pathianin mal a sâwm dâwn che u a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, in thinlungin khaw dang a hawia, in ngaihthlâk lohva, hruai bova in awma, pathian dangte in biaka, a rawng te in bâwl chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />in boral ngei ngei ang tih tûnah hian ka hrilh che u a ni; Jordan lui kâna, luah tûra in va luhna ramah chuan in dam rei lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />In hmaah nunna leh thihna, malsâwmna leh ânchhia ka dah tih tûnah hian in chungchâng thûa hretu atân lei leh vân ka ko a ni; chutichuan, nunna chu thlang rawh u, in nun theih nân, nangni leh in thlahte nên;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathian hmangaiha, a awkâ awiha, amah vuan tlatin; amah chu in nunna, in dam reina a ni si a; tichuan, in pu Abrahama te, Isaaka te, Jakoba te chhechhama pêk a tiam ramah chuan in awm dâwn a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Mosian Israel mi zawng zawng hnênah hêng thu hi a va sawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />An hnênah, “Tûnah chuan kum za leh sawmhnih ka lo ni ta a; ka chhuakvâk thei tawh lo va; tin, Lalpan , ‘He Jordan lui hi i kân lo vang,’ mi ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathian chuan in hma a hruai ang a; hêng hnamte hi a tihbosak ang che u a, an ram chu in luah ang; tin, Lalpan a lo sawi tawh angin Josuan in hma a hruai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Amor-ho lalte, Sihona leh Oga leh an ram chunga a tih ang khân an chungah a ti ang; anni chu a tiboral a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpan anni chu a hlân ang che u a, thu ka pêk che u thupêk ang zawng zawng khân an chungah in ti tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chhel tak leh huai takin awm ula, ṭih suh ula, anni chu hlau hek suh u; in hnêna kala chu Lalpa in Pathian a ni si a; a tithlâwn lo vang che u a, kal pawh a kalsan tawp lo vang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Mosian Josua chu a ko va, Israel mite zawng zawng mit hmuhah a hnênah, “Chak tak leh huai takin awm rawh, hêng mite hnênah hian an pi leh pute Lalpan chhechhama pêk a lo tiam tawh ramah chuan i kal tûr a ni a, anniho hi i luahtîr tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, i hmahruaitu chu Lalpa a ni ang a, i hnênah a awm zêl ang a, a tithlâwn lo vang chia, kal pawh a kalsan tawp lo vang che; hlau suh la, zâm hek suh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Mosia chuan chu dân chu a ziak a, Lalpa thuthlung bâwm zâwntu Levia fapa puithiamte leh Israel upateho zawng zawng chu a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tichuan, Mosian, “Kum sarih kum, ngaihdam kum apianga bâwkte kûtah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />hmun a la ruat tûra Israel mi zawng zawng Lalpa in Pathian hmaa an rawn inlan hunah, he dân hi Israel mi zawng zawng hriatah in chhiar tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mipuiho a hmei a pa, in fanau tê tê te, in awmpui ram dang mi te, anni chuan an ngaihthlâka, an zira, Lalpa in Pathian chu an ṭiha, he dân thu zawng zawng hi fîmkhur taka an zawm theih nân leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />an fate, la hre ve lote pawhin an hriata, Jordan lui kâna in va luah tûr rama in awm chhûng zawng zawnga Lalpa in Pathian ṭih an zir theih nân ko khâwm rawh u,” tiin thu a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia hnênah, “Ngai teh, i thih hun a lo hnai ta a; Josua chu ko la, inbiakna puan inah chuan va inlan rawh u, thu ka pe dâwn e,” a ti a. Tin, Mosia leh Josua chu an kal a, inbiakna puan inah chuan an va inlan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chu puan inah chuan chhûmdingin a inlâr a; tin, chhûmding chu puan in kawngka lû chungah chuan a ding a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia hnênah, “Ngai teh, i pi leh pute hnênah i muhîl dâwn ta a, hêng mite hi an tho vang a, an va awmna tûrte zînga ram dang pathiante lakah chuan an uirê ang a, mi hawisan ang a, ka thuthlung an hnêna ka thlun chu an bawhchhia ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chutichuan, chumi hun chuan an chungah ka thin a thawk ang a, ka hawisan ang a, ka bîkbosan ang a, an ral ang a, thil ṭha lo leh manganna tam tak an chungah a thleng ang a; chutichuan, chumi ni chuan, ‘Kan Pathian kan zînga a awm loh avângin hêng thil ṭha lo hi kan chungah a lo thleng a ni lâwm ni?’ an ti ang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pathian dangte lam hawia thil ṭha lo an la tih tûr zawng zawng avâng chuan, an lakah chumi hun chuan ka inthup ngei ngei dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chuvângin, hetiang hla hi in tân phuah la, Israela thlahte zirtîr rawh; Israela thlahte chungchâng thûah he hla hi mi hriatpuitu a nih theih nân vawntîr rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />An pi leh pute hnêna chhechhama ka tiam, hnute tui leh khawizua luang ramah chuan ka hruaia, ei leh bâra an awma, an tlaia, an lo thau hun meuh chuan pathian dangte lam an hawi ang a, an rawng te an bâwl ang a, mi hmusit ang a, ka thuthlungte an bawhchhe dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni ang a, thil ṭha lo leh manganna tam tak an chunga a lo thlen hunin, he hla hi a hriat chhuahtîrtu a ni ang; an thlahte kâ aṭangin theihnghilh theih a ni dâwn si lo va; tûnah ka chhechham rama ka hruai hma rêng pawhin an suangtuah vêl dân chu ka hre sa tawh reng a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chutichuan, Mosian chu hla chu chumi ni la la chuan a phuah a, Israela thlahte a zirtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, Nuna fapa Josua chu a fuih a, “Chhel tak leh huai takin awm rawh khai; Israela thlahte chu an hnêna chhechhama ka tiam ramah chuan i hruai lût dâwn a ni; tin, i hnênah ka awm zêl ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, Mosian he dân thûte hi lehkhabua a ziak zawha peih diam a nih hnuin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />thuthlung bâwm zâwntu Levi-hote chu Mosian,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“He dân bu hi la ula, in chungchâng thûa hretu atân Lalpa in Pathian thuthlung bâwm sîrah dah rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hel in chînzia leh in luhlulziate ka hria a ni; ngai teh u, tûna ka la dampui lai che u mahin Lalpa chungah in hel ṭhîn a; ka thih hnu lek phei chuan eng ti takin nasa ang maw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />An beng hriata hêng thu hi ka sawia, an chungchâng thûa hretua lei leh vân ka koh theih nân in hnam puipa zawng zawngte, in hotute mi koh khâwmsak rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ka thih hnu chuan nasa takin in intichhia ang a, ka thupêk che u kawng ata hi in pêng ang tih ka hre reng a ni; tin, a tâwpah phei chuan thil ṭha lovin a tlâkbuak ang che u; in kut thiltiha tithinur tûra Lalpa mit hmuha thil ṭha lo in tih dâwn avângin,” tiin thu a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tichuan, Mosian Israel pung khâwmho zawng zawng beng hriatah chuan he hla thu hi a tâwp thlengin a sawi vek a:
  </para>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Beng lo chhi ru, vânte u, ka hril dâwn e; Ka ṭawngkam chhuak leilungin ngai se:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ruahtui angin ka thu chu a sûr ang, Dai angin ka thusawi chu a far ang; Hlobet no dep chunga ruah ang leh, Hnim hnah chunga ruah angin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalpa hming chu ka puang dâwn e: Ropuina kan Pathian pe ru.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lungpuia chu, a thiltih a fel famkim; A awm dân zawng zawng chu dân a ni a, Pathian rinawm, khawlohna nei lo, Fel leh ṭha a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ṭha lo takin a chungah an ti a, a fate an ni lo, an sawisêl kaina a ni: Chhuan bengtla lo leh tihmawh an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aw, mi â leh fing lote u, Chutin maw, Lalpa chu in thungrulh dâwn? A hringtu che, i pa a ni lâwm ni? A siam chia, a din nghet che a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hmasâng nite chu hre reng la, Chhuan tam tak kumte chu ngaihtuah teh. I pa zâwt la, a kawhhmuh ang che; I upate pawh, an hrilh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chungnungberan hnamte ram a pêk laia, Mihring fate a ṭhen lai khân Hnamte ramri a kham a, Israela thlahte zâtin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lalpa chanvo chu a mite an ni a; Jakob-ho chu a rochan an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thlalêr ramah a chhar a, Thlalêr ruak rûm vung vungah; A vêla awm chilhin a enkawl a, A mitnautê angin a vawng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mupuiin a bua no a chawk thova, A no chunga thla a zâpa, A thlate a zâra, a laa, A thlaa a chawi ṭhîn angin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lalpa chauhvin a hruai ṭhîn a, Ram dang pathian ni lovin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lei hmun sângah te a chuantîr a. Lova thil hâwng a eitîr ṭhîn a; Lungpui ata khawizu a dâwttîr ṭhîn a. Lung chang ata hriak nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bâwnghnute khal, berâm hnutê, Berâmno thaute nên; Basan ram berâmpa leh kêlte, Buh kal thaute nên; Grêp thisen, uain i in a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mahse, Jesurun-ho an lo thau va, an inchhek a; I lo thau va, i lo chum a, i lo maih ta! A siamtu Pathian a hawisan ta a, A chhandamna Lungpui chu a ngainêp.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ram dang pathiantein a thîkthu a chawk tho va, Thil tenawmin a chawk thinrim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pathian ni lo, ramhuaite hnênah an inthawi a, An hriat ngai loh pathiante hnênah, Pathian tharte tlai khawhnua lo awm, In pi, in pute hlauh ngai loh hnênan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A hringtu che Lungpui i ngaisâng lo, A siamtu che Pathian i theihnghilh bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chu chu Lalpan a hmu a, a hua, A fanu leh fapate tihthinur vângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />‘Ka bîkbosan ang a, Engtin nge an awm dâwn teh rêng,’ a ti; Chhuan bengtla lo an ni, Rin kai lo fanaute.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Pathian ni lo thilin ka thîkthu an chawk tho va; An thil lawilovin mi tithinur a. Chia sawi lohtein ka thîktîr ang a. Hnam âtein ka tithinrim ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ka thinur a alh a, Seol mawng kil lam a kâng, Leilung, a thil hâwng chawpin a kâng zo, Tlâng nghahchhante a kâng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />An chungah chhiatna ka tiang khâwm ang a, An chungah thal ka thlah ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Rilṭâmin an râwp ang a, meipui leh chhiatna namên lovin a kâng ral ang, An chungah ramsa hâte ka tîr ang a, Vaivuta tleng mite tûr nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Pâwn lamah khandaihin an thi ang a, Chhûng lamah thlabârin, Nula tlangvâl, hnute hne lai, Lûa kêlsam ṭote nên lam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />An hmêlmate chuan ngai sualin, ‘Kan kut chu chawi sânin a awm ta, Hêng zawng zawng hi Lalpa tih a ni tawp lo,’ hmêlma thinrim chuan an ti ang tih hlauthâwng lo ila chuan, ‘Ka tidarh vek ang a, Mihring zînga anmahni hriat rengna ka tibo teh daih ang,’ ka ti mai tûr.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Finna nei lo hnam an ni a, Anmahniah hriat thiamna a awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Aw, fing sela chuan hêng hi an hre thiam ang a, An tûn hnu lam thu an ngaihtuah tûr.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Engtin nge pakhatin sâng a ûm ang a, Pahnihin sîng an tlânchhiattîr ang, An Lungpuiin a hralha, Lalpan a hlan a nih si loh chuan?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />An lungpui chu kan Lungpui ang a ni si lo, Kan hmêlmate ngei ngaih dân pawhin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A grêp hrui chu Sodom grêp hrui, Gomorra rama mi a ni; A grêpte chu mît grêp a ni, A bâwrte chu a khâ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />An uain te chu dragon tûr leh rûlrial tûr ṭha tak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Chu chu ka khâwl khâwm, Ka ro bâwma châr chiah a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Phuba lâk leh thungrulh chu keima tih tûr a ni; An rahbi a la tleu ngei dâwn e; An chhiatna ni chu a lo hnai ta, An chunga thil lo thleng tûrte chu a lo thleng thuai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Lalpa chuan a mite ro a rêl dâwn a, A chhiahhlawhte pawh a tihsak ang, A thiltihtheihna bova, Khuahkhirh leh khirh loh tu mah rêng awm lova a hmuh hun chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Khawiah nge an pathian, an rin lungpui,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />An inthawina thau eitu, an in tur thilhlan uain intute chu? Lo thovin rawn pui che u sela, Nangmahni humtu ni rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Kei, keimah ngei ka nih hi hria ula, Pathian dang an awm lo ve; Ka tihlum ṭhîn a, ka tinung bawk ṭhîn; Ka hliam ṭhîn a, ka tidam bawk ṭhîn; Ka kut ata mi chhuhsak thei rêng rêngan awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Vân lamah ka kut ka phar a, Ka nunna chhâlin ka sawi e,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Ka khandaih tlê ka tah hriama, Ka kutin rorêlna a vawn chuan, Ka hmêlmate chungah phuba ka la ang a, Mi hawtute chu ka thungrûl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Ka thalte chu thisenin ka tirui ang a, Ka khandaihin tisa a lem ang; Thahte leh salte thisen nên Hmêlma hotute lû aṭangin, ka ti, a ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Aw, nangni hnam tinte u, a mite nên lâwm rawh u; A chhiahhlawhte thisen phuba chu a la dâwn a ni; Amah dotute chungah phuba a la dâwn, A ram leh a mite tân inremna famkim a siam ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tin, mipuite beng hriatah chûng hla thu zawng zawng chu Mosian a va sawi a, amah nên, Nuna fapa Hosea nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tin, Mosian chûng thu zawng zawng chu Israel mi zawng zawng hnêna a sawi zawh chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />an hnênah, “Tûna in hnêna ka thu hriattîr che uah hian in thinlung nghat tlat ula, hêng dân thu zawng zawng hi fîmkhur taka zâwm tûrin in fate thu pe rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />In tân thil eng mah lo mai mai a ni lo va, in nunna a ni si; tin, hêng thil ti hian luah tûra Jordan in va kân ramah chuan in dam rei dâwn a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tin, chumi ni vêk chuan Lalpan Mosia a bia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />“Moab rama Jeriko zâwna Abarim tlângdunga Nebo tlângah chuan han chho la, Israela thlahte luah tûra ka pêk Kanaan ram chu han thlîr rawh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />tichuan, i unaupa Arona Hor tlânga a thia, a chite hnêna hruai a ni ta ang bawk khân i lâwn chhohna tlângah chuan i thi ang a, i chite hnêna hruai i ni ang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Zin thlalêra Kadesh-a Meriba tuia Israela thlahte zînga ka chunga in sual avâng leh, Israela thlahte zînga mi chawimawi loh avâng khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Ram chu i han hmu ang a; nimahsela, Israela thlahte ka pêk ramah chuan i lût lo vang,” tiin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />He malsâwmna hian a ni, Pathian mi Mosian a thih hmaa Israela thlahte mal a sâwm ni:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Sinai aṭangin Lalpa chu a lo kal a, Seir aṭangin an hnênah a thawk a, Paran tlâng aṭangin a êng chhuak a, Mi thianghlim sângsâwm zîng aṭangin a lo kal; A kut ding lamah chuan an tân dân alh thei a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A ni, chi tinte chu a hmangaih a, A mi thianghlim zawng zawng chu i kutah an awm a, I ke bulah an ṭhu a; I thu chu an pawm ṭheuh vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mosia chuan dân min pe a, Jakob-ho mipui tân roluah tûr.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jesurun-ah a lal a, Mipuiho puipate an pung khâwm a, Israel chi zawng zawng a huhovin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Reubena chu dam reng sela, thi lovin, A mite erawh chu tlêm thung rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, hei hi Juda-ho mal a sâwmna a ni: “ Lalpa , Juda aw chu ngaithla la, A mite hnênah hruai lût rawh; A kutin a tân a chuh a, A hmêlmate beihpuitu i ni ang,” tih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Levi-ho chung thûah chuan: “I Thumim leh i Urim chu i mi thianghlim hnênah a awm, Masa-a i fiaha, Meriba tuiahte i beih kha;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />‘Ka nu leh ka pa ka hre lo,’ titu khân, A unaute a hre lo, Ama fate ngei pawh a hre hek lo; I thu chu an pawm a, I thuthlung an zâwm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jakob-ho chu i rorêlte an zirtîr ang a, Israel-hote, i dân. I hmaah rimtui an dah ang, I maichâmah pumhâl thilhlan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Malsâwm rawh, Lalpa , a sum a pai, A kutkawihte lo pawm la; A beitute kâwng chu vua la, A hawtute kâwng nên, an chêt leh tawh loh nân,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Benjamin-ho chung thûah chuan: “ Lalpa duh taka chu a kiangah himin a awm ang, Nilêngin a awp ang a, A paw ṭhîn ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Josef-ho chung thûah chuan: “A ram chu Lalpa malsâwmin awm rawh se, Vân thil hlu, daitein, Tui thûk tak hnuai lama tuitein,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ni rah chhuah thil hlûtein, Thlaten thil hlû a chhuah tein,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hmasâng tlângtea thil duhawm bertein, Chatuan tlânga thil hlûtein,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Leilung leh a chunga thil hlûtein, Hnim buka awma duhsaknain; Malsâwmna chu Josef-ho lu chungah lo awm rawh se, A unaute hnên ata tihhrana chhîpah chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A ropuina chu a bâwngpa piang hmasa ropuina ang a ni a, A kî chu selechal kî ang a ni; Chûng chuan hnam tin a si ang, kâwlkil thlengin; Ephraim-ho sângsâwmte an ni a, Manase-ho sângte an ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, Zebulun-ho chung thûah chuan: “Lâwm rawh, Zebulun, i chhuahvahnaah te, Tin, Isakar, i puan inahte.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tlângah chi tin an ko vang a, Tah chuan felna inthawinate an hlân ang; Tuifinriat mukna an tlân dâwn si, Ṭiauva ro inphûmte nên,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Gad-ho chung thûah chuan: “Gad-ho tizautu chu fakin awm rawh se. Sakeibakneipui angin a châng a, Bân a ham thlêr a, a ni, chhîp zawl te pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A ṭha lai ber a tân a thlang a. Rorêltu chanvo chu vohvin a awm si a. Puipahote hnênah a kal a, Lalpa rorêlna fel a zui a; Israel-te hnêna a rorêlnate chu,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Dan-ho chung thûah chuan: “Dana chu sakeibakneino a ni, Basan aṭanga lo zuang chhuak chu,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Naphtali-ho chung thûah chuan: “Aw, Naphtali, duhsaknaa lungawi, Lalpa malsâwmnaa tlai, Chhim leh thlang luah rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Aser-ho chung thûah chuan: “Asera chu fanauva malsâwmin awm sela, A unaute zîngah tlatlum sela; Hriakah a ke chiah rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />I kalhnate chu thîr leh dâr a ni ang, I dam chhûng ni angin i chakna pawh a awm ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Pathian ang tu mah rêng an awm lo, aw Jesurun, A pui tûr chea vâna chuang, Ropui taka vâna chuang chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Chatuan Pathian chu i awmna a ni a, Hnuai lamah chuan chatuan bân a awm, Hmêlmate chu a vai kiansak chia, ‘Tiboral rawh,’ a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, Israela chu râlmuang takin a awm a, Jakoba tuichhunchhuah a pumbil; Buh leh uain ramah chuan, A ni, a vânten daifîm an fartîr.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />I nihlawh e, aw Israel, Nang ang rêng tu nge awm, Lalpa chhandam mite? Nangmah puitu phaw, I ropuina khandaih a ni. I hmêlmate i hnênah an intulût ang a, An hmun sângte i chîl ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Mosia chu Moab phai aṭangin Jeriko zâwna Nebo tlâng, Pisga tlâng chhipah chuan a han chho va. Tin, Lalpan Gilead ram zawng zawng, Dan thlengin a entîr a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Naphtali leh Ephraim ram zawng zawng, Manase leh Judai ram zawng zawng, a thlang lam tuifinriat thleng,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chhim ram leh tûm khawpui Jeriko phai ruam, Zoar thlengin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan a hnênah, “He ram hi a ni, Abrahama te, Isaaka te, Jakoba te hnêna, ‘I thlahte ka la pe ang,’ tia chhechhama ka lo tiam kha; a hmuh zawng ka hmuhtîr phawt chia; nimahsela, chutah chuan i kal lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chutichuan, Lalpa chhiahhlawh Mosia chu Lalpa thu angin Moab ramah chuan a thi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Beth-peor zâwna Moab rama ruamah a phûm a; nimahsela, a thlân chu tûn thlengin tu mahin an hre lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mosia chu a thih chuan kum za leh kum sawmhnih mi a ni; a mit a thim lo va, a tha pawh a ṭhum chuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Israela thlahte chuan Mosia chu Moab phaiah ni sawmthum an ṭah a; chutichuan, Mosia sûna ṭah nite chu a lo tâwp ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Nuna fapa Josua chu finna thlarauvin a khat a, Mosia chuan a chungah a kut a nghah avângin; tin, Israela thlahte chuan a thu an zâwm a, Lalpan Mosia thu a pêk ang chuan an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, chuta chin chu Israel-te zîngah, Mosia anga Lalpan hmaichhan meuhva a biak zâwlnei rêng rêng an awm ta lo va,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />chhinchhiahnate zawng zawng leh thilmak zawng zawng, Pharaoa leh a chhiahhlawh zawng zawng hnên leh Aigupta ram zawng zawnga entîra,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />kut chak tak leh hlauhawm tak tak tea Israel mi zawng zawng mit hmuha Mosian a tih ang ti vete.
  </para>
</usx>
